msgid "Chamber temperature"
msgstr "腔体温度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:709
msgid ""
"Required chamber temperature for the print.\n"
"When set to zero, the nominal chamber temperature is not set in the G-code."
msgstr ""
"打印所需的腔体温度。\n"
"设为零时，G-code 中不设置标称腔体温度。"

#. TRN: Label of a configuration parameter: Minimal chamber temperature
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:719 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2339
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2357 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3715
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "最小"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:720
msgid "Chamber minimal temperature"
msgstr "腔体最低温度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:721
msgid ""
"Minimal chamber temperature that the printer waits for before the print "
"starts. This allows to start the print before the nominal chamber "
"temperature is reached.\n"
"When set to zero, the minimal chamber temperature is not set in the G-code."
msgstr ""
"打印开始前打印机等待达到的最低腔体温度。这样可在达到标称腔体温度之前开始打"
"印。\n"
"设为零时，G-code 中不设置最低腔体温度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:731
msgid "Bed temperature by extruder"
msgstr "按挤出机设定热床温度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:732 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1448
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2568 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3426
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3697 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4307
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4645 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4687
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5402 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:186
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2144 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2283
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:3832
msgid "Extruders"
msgstr "挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:733
msgid ""
"The extruder which determines bed temperatures. Set to 0 to determine "
"temperatures based on the first printing extruder of the first and the "
"second layers."
msgstr ""
"决定热床温度的挤出机。设为 0 时，根据第一层和第二层的首个打印挤出机来确定温"
"度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:742
msgid ""
"This custom code is inserted at every layer change, right before the Z move. "
"Note that you can use placeholder variables for all Slic3r settings as well "
"as [layer_num] and [layer_z]."
msgstr ""
"此自定义代码在 Z 移动之前，每次图层更改时都会插入。请注意，您可以将占位符变量"
"用于所有 Slic3r 设置以及 [layer_num] 和 [layer_z]。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:752
msgid "Between objects G-code"
msgstr "对象之间的 G-Code"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:754
msgid ""
"This code is inserted between objects when using sequential printing. By "
"default extruder and bed temperature are reset using non-wait command; "
"however if M104, M109, M140 or M190 are detected in this custom code, Slic3r "
"will not add temperature commands. Note that you can use placeholder "
"variables for all Slic3r settings, so you can put a \"M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]\" command wherever you want."
msgstr ""
"使用顺序打印时, 此代码将插入对象之间。默认情况下, 使用非等待命令重置挤出机和"
"床温;但是, 如果在此自定义代码中检测到 m104、m109、m140 或 m190,Slic3r 将不会"
"添加温度命令。请注意, 您可以对所有 Slic3r 设置使用占位符变量, 因此您可以将  "
"\"M109S[first_layer_temperature]\" 命令放在任何需要的地方。"

#. TRN Print Settings: "Bottom solid layers"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:763 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:771
msgctxt "Layers"
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:765
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on bottom surfaces."
msgstr "要在底部曲面上生成的实心图层数。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:766 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1728
msgid "Bottom solid layers"
msgstr "底部实心层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:773
msgid ""
"The number of bottom solid layers is increased above bottom_solid_layers if "
"necessary to satisfy minimum thickness of bottom shell."
msgstr ""
"如果有必要满足底部壳体的最小厚度，底部实体层的数量将增加到底部实体层之上。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:775
msgid "Minimum bottom shell thickness"
msgstr "最小底壳厚度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:781 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2271
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6899
msgid "Bridge"
msgstr "网桥"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:782
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for bridges. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for bridges."
msgstr "这是打印机用于搭桥的加速。设置为零以禁用搭桥的加速度控制。"

