#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:821 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6889
msgid "Enable manual fan speeds"
msgstr "启用手动风扇转速"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:822
msgid ""
"When enabled, use the manual fan speed values below for each feature type. "
"This disables dynamic overhang fan speeds to prevent conflicting fan "
"commands. Useful for fine-tuned control over fan behavior per feature."
msgstr ""
"启用后，对每种特征类型使用下方的手动风扇转速值。这会禁用动态悬垂风扇转速，以"
"防止冲突的风扇指令。适合对每种特征的风扇行为进行精细控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:829 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1590
msgid "Overhang perimeters"
msgstr "悬垂轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:830
msgid ""
"Fan speed for overhang perimeters. Used in both auto cooling and manual fan "
"modes. In auto mode, this overrides the bridge fan speed specifically for "
"overhang perimeters. Set to 0 to use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr ""
"悬垂轮廓的风扇转速。自动冷却和手动风扇模式下均使用。在自动模式下，此值会专门"
"针对悬垂轮廓覆盖桥接风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:840 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1974
msgid "Interlocking perimeters"
msgstr "互锁轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:841
msgid ""
"Fan speed for interlocking perimeters when auto cooling is disabled. Set to "
"0 to use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时互锁轮廓的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:851
msgid ""
"Fan speed for serpentine extrusions when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 "
"to use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时蛇形挤出的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:860 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1598
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6896 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6924
msgid "Serpentine overhang"
msgstr "蛇形悬垂设置"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:861
msgid ""
"Fan speed for overhanging serpentine extrusions when auto cooling is "
"disabled. Set to 0 to use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时悬垂蛇形挤出的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:870 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1397
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1410 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2308
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3417 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2059
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2105 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2268
msgid "External perimeters"
msgstr "外部轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:871
msgid ""
"Fan speed for external perimeters when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to "
"use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时外轮廓的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:880
msgid "Internal perimeters"
msgstr "内轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:881
msgid ""
"Fan speed for internal perimeters when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to "
"use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时内轮廓的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:891
msgid ""
"Fan speed for top solid infill when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to "
"use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时顶部实心填充的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:901
msgid ""
"Fan speed for solid infill (not top) when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 "
"to use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr ""
"禁用自动冷却时实心填充（非顶部）的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:910
msgid "Sparse infill"
msgstr "稀疏填充"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:911
msgid ""
"Fan speed for sparse internal infill when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 "
"to use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时稀疏内部填充的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:921
msgid ""
"Fan speed for ironing passes when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to use "
"no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时熨烫走线的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:931
msgid ""
"Fan speed for skirt and brim when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to use "
"no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时围裙和边缘的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:941
msgid ""
"Fan speed for support material when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to "
"use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时支撑材料的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:951
msgid ""
"Fan speed for support interface when auto cooling is disabled. Set to 0 to "
"use no fan for this feature type."
msgstr "禁用自动冷却时支撑接触面的风扇转速。设为 0 则此特征类型不使用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:960 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2295
msgid "Bridge flow ratio"
msgstr "桥接流量比"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:962
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of plastic for bridging. You can decrease it "
"slightly to pull the extrudates and prevent sagging, although default "
"settings are usually good and you should experiment with cooling (use a fan) "
"before tweaking this."
msgstr ""
"此因子影响用于桥接的耗材量。您可以稍微减小它挤出和防止下垂，虽然默认设置通常"
"很好，您应该尝试冷却（使用风扇），然后再调整它。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:975
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for bridges. "
"Bridges print in mid-air and cannot squish against a layer below, so using a "
"narrower width (around nozzle diameter) produces better results than the "
"wider solid infill width. If left zero, solid infill extrusion width will be "
"used. If expressed as percentage (for example 110%) it will be computed over "
"nozzle diameter or layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to "
"nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置桥接的挤出宽度。桥接在半空中打印，无法压在下一层上，因此"
"使用较窄的宽度（约等于喷嘴直径）比更宽的实心填充宽度效果更好。若保持为零，将"
"使用实心填充挤出宽度。若以百分比表示（例如 110%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百"
"分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:987
msgid "Single perimeter on top surfaces"
msgstr "顶面单层轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:990
msgid ""
"Use only one perimeter on flat top surface, to give more space to the top "
"infill pattern. Could be applied on topmost surface or all top surfaces."
msgstr ""
"在平坦顶面上只使用一条轮廓，为顶部填充图案留出更多空间。可应用于最顶层表面或"
"所有顶面。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:993 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1357
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2433 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4251
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "禁用"

