#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4771 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5135
msgid "mm/s or %"
msgstr "mm/s 或 %"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1026 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2075
msgid "Enable dynamic overhang speeds"
msgstr "启用动态悬挑速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1028
msgid "This setting enables dynamic speed control on overhangs."
msgstr "此设置启用悬挑的动态速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1034
msgid ""
"Overhang size is expressed as the percentage of the extrusion that is "
"unsupported by the previous layer: 100% is fully unsupported (floating "
"extrusion, bridge), while 0% is fully supported (no overhang). Speeds for "
"overhang sizes in between are calculated via linear interpolation. If set as "
"percentage, the speed is calculated over the external perimeter speed. Note "
"that the speeds generated to gcode will never exceed the max volumetric flow "
"value."
msgstr ""
"悬垂尺寸表示为前一层未支撑的挤出比例：100%完全无支撑（浮动挤出、桥接），0%完"
"全有支撑（无悬垂）。中间悬垂尺寸的速度通过线性插值计算。若设置为百分比，速度"
"相对于外轮廓速度计算。请注意，生成到g-code的速度永远不会超过最大体积流量值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1041 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2076
msgid "Speed at 100% overhang"
msgstr "100%悬垂时的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1050 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2077
msgid "Speed at 75% overhang"
msgstr "75%悬垂时的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1059 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2078
msgid "Speed at 50% overhang"
msgstr "50%悬垂时的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1068 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2079
msgid "Speed at 25% overhang"
msgstr "25%悬垂时的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1077 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6911
msgid "Enable dynamic fan speeds"
msgstr "启用动态风扇速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1078
msgid "This setting enables dynamic fan speed control on overhangs."
msgstr "此设置可在悬挑上启用动态风扇速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1084
msgid ""
"Overhang size is expressed as a percentage of overlap of the extrusion with "
"the previous layer: 100% would be full overlap (no overhang), while 0% "
"represents full overhang (floating extrusion, bridge). Fan speeds for "
"overhang sizes in between are calculated via linear interpolation."
msgstr ""
"悬挑尺寸表示为拉伸与上一层重叠的百分比：100%表示完全重叠（无悬挑），而0%表示"
"完全悬挑（浮动拉伸、桥接）。介于两者之间的悬挑尺寸的风扇速度通过线性插值计"
"算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1089 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6912
msgid "Overhang fan speed 0%"
msgstr "悬垂风扇转速 0%"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1098 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6913
msgid "Overhang fan speed 25%"
msgstr "悬垂风扇转速 25%"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1107 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6914
msgid "Overhang fan speed 50%"
msgstr "悬垂风扇转速 50%"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1116 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6915
msgid "Overhang fan speed 75%"
msgstr "悬垂风扇转速 75%"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1125 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1929
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2170
msgid "Brim width"
msgstr "裙边宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1126 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1137
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1151 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1161
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1173 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:189
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1632 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2110
msgid "Skirt and brim"
msgstr "环绕和裙边"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1127
msgid ""
"The horizontal width of the brim that will be printed around each object on "
"the first layer. When raft is used, no brim is generated (use "
"raft_first_layer_expansion)."
msgstr ""
"边缘的水平宽度，将围绕第一层上的每个对象打印。使用筏板时，不会产生边缘（使用"
"筏板_第一层_扩展）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1136 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1928
msgid "Brim type"
msgstr "裙边类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1138
msgid ""
"The places where the brim will be printed around each object on the first "
"layer."
msgstr "边缘将在第一层上的每个对象周围打印的位置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1140
msgid "Advanced mouse ears"
msgstr "高级鼠标耳"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1141
msgid "Auto mouse ears"
msgstr "自动鼠标耳"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1142
msgid "Outer brim only"
msgstr "仅外部裙边"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1143
msgid "Inner brim only"
msgstr "仅内部裙边"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1145
msgid "Outer and inner brim"
msgstr "内部和外部裙边"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1150
msgid "Brim separation gap"
msgstr "裙边分离间隙"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1153
msgid ""
"Offset of brim from the printed object. The offset is applied after the "
"elephant foot compensation."
msgstr "裙边与印刷品的偏移量。偏移在大象脚补偿后应用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1160
msgid "Brim ear max angle"
msgstr "边缘耳最大角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1162
msgid ""
"Maximum angle to let a brim ear appear. If set to 0, no brim will be "
"created. If set to ~180, brim will be created on everything but straight "
"sections."
msgstr ""
"允许出现边缘耳的最大角度。设为 0 则不创建边缘。设为约 180 则除直线段外都会创"
"建边缘。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1172
msgid "Brim ear detection radius"
msgstr "边缘耳检测半径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1174
msgid ""
"The geometry will be decimated before detecting sharp angles. This parameter "
"indicates the minimum length of the deviation for the decimation. 0 to "
"deactivate."
msgstr ""
"在检测尖角之前会对几何体进行抽稀。此参数表示抽稀偏差的最小长度。设为 0 可停"
"用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1183
msgid "Colorprint height"
msgstr "彩色打印高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1184
msgid "Heights at which a filament change is to occur."
msgstr "发生耗材变化的高度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1188 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:122
msgid "Compatible printers"
msgstr "兼容打印机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1194
msgid "Compatible printers condition"
msgstr "兼容打印机条件"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1195
msgid ""
"A boolean expression using the configuration values of an active printer "
"profile. If this expression evaluates to true, this profile is considered "
"compatible with the active printer profile."
msgstr ""
"使用活动打印机配置文件的配置值的布尔表达式。如果此表达式计算为 true,则此配置"
"文件将被视为与活动打印机配置文件兼容。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1203 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:128
msgid "Compatible print profiles"
msgstr "兼容的打印配置文件"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1209
msgid "Compatible print profiles condition"
msgstr "兼容的打印配置文件条件"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1210
msgid ""
"A boolean expression using the configuration values of an active print "
"profile. If this expression evaluates to true, this profile is considered "
"compatible with the active print profile."
msgstr ""
"使用活动打印配置文件的配置值的布尔表达式。如果此表达式计算为 true,则此配置文"
"件将被视为与活动打印配置文件兼容。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1227 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2345
msgid "Complete individual objects"
msgstr "完成单个对象"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1228
msgid ""
"When printing multiple objects or copies, this feature will complete each "
"object before moving onto next one (and starting it from its bottom layer). "
"This feature is useful to avoid the risk of ruined prints. Slic3r should "
"warn and prevent you from extruder collisions, but beware."
msgstr ""
"打印多个对象或副本时，此功能将完成每个对象，然后再移动到下一个对象（并从其底"
"层开始）。此功能可用于避免打印损坏的风险。Slic3r 应警告并防止挤出机碰撞，但要"
"小心。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1236 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6869
msgid "Enable auto cooling"
msgstr "启用自动冷却"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1237
msgid ""
"This flag enables the automatic cooling logic that adjusts print speed and "
"fan speed according to layer printing time."
msgstr "此标志启用自动冷却逻辑，可根据图层打印时间调整打印速度和风扇速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1242
msgid "Cooling slowdown logic"
msgstr "冷却减速逻辑"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1244
msgid ""
"Determines how the printer slows down layer printing when the minimum layer "
"time isn't reached. 'Consistent surface' first tries to preserve the print "
"speeds of the first two perimeters by slowing all other features. Only if "
"this isn't sufficient, it also slows down those first two perimeters. "
"'Uniform cooling' slows down all print features, including the first two "
"perimeters."
msgstr ""
"决定打印机在未达到最小层时间时如何减慢层打印速度。“一致表面”首先尝试通过减慢"
"所有其他特征来保持前两条轮廓的打印速度。仅当这样还不够时，才会减慢前两条轮"
"廓。“均匀冷却”会减慢包括前两条轮廓在内的所有打印特征。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1249
msgid "Uniform cooling"
msgstr "均匀冷却"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1250
msgid "Consistent surface"
msgstr "一致表面"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1255 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6872
msgid "Perimeter transition distance"
msgstr "轮廓过渡距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1257
msgid ""
"Distance in millimeters before non-slowed perimeters where the original "
"unslowed print speed is restored. This reduces print quality issues when "
"transitioning from heavily slowed feature to fast perimeter printing."
msgstr ""
"在未减速的轮廓之前恢复原始未减速打印速度的距离（毫米）。这可减少从大幅减速的"
"特征过渡到快速轮廓打印时的打印质量问题。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1264 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:4029
msgid "Cooling tube position"
msgstr "冷却管位置"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1265
msgid "Distance of the center-point of the cooling tube from the extruder tip."
msgstr "冷却管中心点与挤出机尖端的距离。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1272 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:4030
msgid "Cooling tube length"
msgstr "冷却管长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1273
msgid "Length of the cooling tube to limit space for cooling moves inside it."
msgstr "冷却管的长度，以限制冷却管内部的冷却移动空间。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1280 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4805
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6205 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:1051
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2104 src/slic3r/Utils/Repetier.cpp:155
#: src/slic3r/Utils/Repetier.cpp:258
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1281
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will be reset to after the role-"
"specific acceleration values are used (perimeter/infill). Set zero to "
"prevent resetting acceleration at all."
msgstr ""
"这是打印机在使用特定于角色的加速值（周长/填充）后将重置为的加速。设置零以防止"
"重置加速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1290
msgid "Default filament profile"
msgstr "默认耗材配置文件"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1291
msgid ""
"Default filament profile associated with the current printer profile. On "
"selection of the current printer profile, this filament profile will be "
"activated."
msgstr ""
"与当前打印机配置文件关联的默认耗材配置文件。在选择当前打印机配置文件时, 将激"
"活此耗材丝配置文件。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1297
msgid "Default print profile"
msgstr "默认打印配置文件"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1298 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6174
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6185
msgid ""
"Default print profile associated with the current printer profile. On "
"selection of the current printer profile, this print profile will be "
"activated."
msgstr ""
"与当前打印机配置文件关联的默认打印配置文件。选择当前打印机配置文件时，将激活"
"此打印配置文件。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1304
msgid "Disable fan for the first"
msgstr "禁用风扇在前"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1305
msgid ""
"You can set this to a positive value to disable fan at all during the first "
"layers, so that it does not make adhesion worse."
msgstr ""
"您可以将此值设置为正值，以便在初始图层期间完全禁用风扇，以免使粘附性恶化。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1307 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2512
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3872 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4239
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4320 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4637
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4701 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4717
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5416
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ExtruderSequenceDialog.cpp:70
msgid "layers"
msgstr "层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1314 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2000
msgid "Don't support bridges"
msgstr "不支持桥接"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1316
msgid ""
"Experimental option for preventing support material from being generated "
"under bridged areas."
msgstr "防止在桥接区域下生成支撑材料的实验选项。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1322
msgid "Distance between copies"
msgstr "副本之间的距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1323
msgid "Distance used for the auto-arrange feature of the plater."
msgstr "用于构建板自动排列功能的距离。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1331
msgid ""
"This end procedure is inserted at the end of the output file. Note that you "
"can use placeholder variables for all preFlight settings."
msgstr ""
"此结束过程插入到输出文件的末尾。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 preFlight "
"设置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1341
msgid ""
"This end procedure is inserted at the end of the output file, before the "
"printer end gcode (and before any toolchange from this filament in case of "
"multimaterial printers). Note that you can use placeholder variables for all "
"preFlight settings. If you have multiple extruders, the gcode is processed "
"in extruder order."
msgstr ""
"此结束过程插入输出文件的末尾、打印机结束 G-Code 之前（以及多材料打印机情况下"
"从该耗材换出任何工具之前）。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 preFlight 设"
"置。如果您有多个挤出机，则按挤出机顺序处理 G-Code。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1352 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1771
msgid "Ensure vertical shell thickness"
msgstr "确保垂直壳层厚度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1354
msgid ""
"Add solid infill near sloping surfaces to guarantee the vertical shell "
"thickness (top+bottom solid layers)."
msgstr "在倾斜表面附近添加实心填充，以保证垂直壳层厚度（顶部+底部实心层）。"

#. TRN: This is a drop-down option for 'Ensure vertical shell thickness' parameter.
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1359
msgid "Partial"
msgstr "部分"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1360 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4251
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1366
msgid "Top solid fill pattern"
msgstr "顶部实心填充图案"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1369
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for top infill. This only affects the top visible layer, and "
"not its adjacent solid shells."
msgstr "填充顶部填充的模式。这仅影响顶部可见图层，而不影响其相邻的实体壳。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1372 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2009
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2036 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4782
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4805
msgid "Rectilinear"
msgstr "直线"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1373 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2037
msgid "Monotonic"
msgstr "单调的"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1374 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2038
msgid "Monotonic Lines"
msgstr "单调线条"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1375 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2010
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2039
msgid "Aligned Rectilinear"
msgstr "直线排列"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1376 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2040
msgid "Aligned Monotonic"
msgstr "对齐单调"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1377 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2016
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2041 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4805
msgid "Concentric"
msgstr "回环"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1378 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2020
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2042
msgid "Hilbert Curve"
msgstr "希尔伯特曲线"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1379 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2021
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2043
msgid "Archimedean Chords"
msgstr "阿基米德和弦"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1380 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2022
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2044
msgid "Octagram Spiral"
msgstr "八角螺旋"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1387
msgid "Bottom solid fill pattern"
msgstr "底部实心填充图案"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1390
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for bottom infill. This only affects the bottom external "
"visible layer, and not its adjacent solid shells."
msgstr "填充底部填充的模式。这仅影响底部外部可见图层，而不影响其相邻的实体壳。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1400
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for external "
"perimeters. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 200%), it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer "
"height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置外轮廓的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已设"
"置），否则使用 1.125 倍喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 200%），将根据“相对于喷"
"嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1412
msgid ""
"This separate setting will affect the speed of external perimeters (the "
"visible ones). If expressed as percentage (for example: 80%) it will be "
"calculated on the perimeters speed setting above. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr ""
"此单独的设置将影响外部轮廓（可见轮廓）的速度。如果以百分比表示（例如：80%）它"
"将在上述周界速度设置上计算。为自动设置为零。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1422 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1790
msgid "External perimeters first"
msgstr "首先打印外部轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1424
msgid ""
"Print contour perimeters from the outermost one to the innermost one instead "
"of the default inverse order."
msgstr "将轮廓周长从最外层的轮廓打印到最里面的轮廓，而不是默认的反向顺序。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1430 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1768
msgid "Extra perimeters if needed"
msgstr "如果需要，打印额外轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1432
msgid ""
"Add more perimeters when needed for avoiding gaps in sloping walls. Slic3r "
"keeps adding perimeters, until more than 70% of the loop immediately above "
"is supported."
msgstr ""
"在需要时添加更多轮廓以避免倾斜壁出现间隙。Slic3r 会不断添加轮廓，直到正上方环"
"路的 70% 以上得到支撑。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1439
msgid "Extra perimeters on overhangs (Experimental)"
msgstr "悬挑上的额外周长（实验）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1441
msgid ""
"Detect overhang areas where bridges cannot be anchored, and fill them with "
"extra perimeter paths. These paths are anchored to the nearby non-overhang "
"area when possible."
msgstr ""
"检测桥梁不能被锚定的悬空区域，用额外的周边路径来填补它们。在可能的情况下，这"
"些路径会被锚定在附近的非悬空区域。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1447 src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3831
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3895 src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3902
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:437 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3458
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:3162 src/slic3r/GUI/wxExtensions.cpp:391
msgid "Extruder"
msgstr "挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1449
msgid ""
"The extruder to use (unless more specific extruder settings are specified). "
"This value overrides perimeter and infill extruders, but not the support "
"extruders."
msgstr ""
"要使用的挤出机（除非指定了更具体的挤出机设置）。此值覆盖轮廓和填充挤出机，但"
"不覆盖支撑挤出机。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1453 src/slic3r/GUI/ExtraRenderers.cpp:272
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:766 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:781
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:1288
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:2375
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:3345
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_ObjectList.cpp:5343
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ObjectDataViewModel.cpp:288
msgid "default"
msgstr "默认"

#. TRN - Input label. Be short as possible
#. Height of one text line - Font Ascent
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1456
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoEmboss.cpp:4384
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ThumbnailsDialog.cpp:144
msgid "Height"
msgstr "高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1458
msgid ""
"Only used when 'Print Settings -> Complete individual objects' is active. "
"Set this to the vertical distance between your nozzle tip and (usually) the "
"X carriage rods. Used to check for collisions with previously printed "
"objects and to prevent them when arranging.\n"
"The value is ignored for printers that come with more detailed extruder "
"models."
msgstr ""
"仅在“打印设置 -> 逐个完成单个物体”激活时使用。请将此值设为喷嘴尖端与（通常"
"是）X 轴滑杆之间的垂直距离。用于检测与先前已打印物体的碰撞并在排版时加以避"
"免。\n"
"对于自带更详细挤出机模型的打印机，此值将被忽略。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1468 src/slic3r/GUI/GLCanvas3D.cpp:407
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "半径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1470
msgid ""
"Only used when 'Print Settings -> Complete individual objects' is active. "
"Set this to a radius of a nozzle-centered cylinder big enough to enclose the "
"extruder assembly. Used to check for collisions with previously printed "
"objects and to prevent them when arranging.\n"
"The value is ignored for printers that come with more detailed extruder "
"models."
msgstr ""
"仅在“打印设置 -> 逐个完成单个物体”激活时使用。请将此值设为以喷嘴为中心、足以"
"容纳挤出机组件的圆柱半径。用于检测与先前已打印物体的碰撞并在排版时加以避"
"免。\n"
"对于自带更详细挤出机模型的打印机，此值将被忽略。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1480 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5464
msgid "Extruder color"
msgstr "挤出机颜色"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1481 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1607
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6019
msgid "This is only used in the Slic3r interface as a visual help."
msgstr "这仅在 Slic3r 界面中用作视觉帮助。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1487 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5561
msgid "Extruder offset"
msgstr "挤出机偏移"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1488
msgid ""
"If your firmware doesn't handle the extruder displacement you need the G-"
"code to take it into account. This option lets you specify the displacement "
"of each extruder with respect to the first one. It expects positive "
"coordinates (they will be subtracted from the XY coordinate)."
msgstr ""
"如果您的固件不处理挤出机位移位，则需要 G-Code 来考虑它。此选项允许您指定每个"
"挤出机相对于第一个挤出机的位移。需要填写正坐标（它们将从 XY 坐标中减去）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1497
msgid "Extrusion axis"
msgstr "挤出轴"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1498
msgid ""
"Use this option to set the axis letter associated to your printer's extruder "
"(usually E but some printers use A)."
msgstr ""
"使用此选项可设置与打印机挤出机关联的轴字母（通常为 E，但某些打印机使用 A）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1503 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6813
msgid "Extrusion multiplier"
msgstr "挤出乘数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1504
msgid ""
"This factor changes the amount of flow proportionally. You may need to tweak "
"this setting to get nice surface finish and correct single wall widths. "
"Usual values are between 0.9 and 1.1. If you think you need to change this "
"more, check filament diameter and your firmware E steps."
msgstr ""
"此因子按比例更改流量。您可能需要调整此设置，以获得漂亮的表面光洁度和正确的单"
"壁宽度。通常值介于 0.9 和 1.1 之间。如果您认为需要更改更多，请检查耗材直径和"
"固件 E 步骤。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1513 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2214
msgid "Percentages relative to nozzle size"
msgstr "相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1515
msgid ""
"When enabled, percentage values in extrusion width fields are computed as a "
"percentage of the nozzle diameter. When disabled, they are computed as a "
"percentage of the layer height (legacy behavior)."
msgstr ""
"启用后，挤出宽度字段中的百分比值将按喷嘴直径的百分比计算。禁用时，则按层高的"
"百分比计算（旧版行为）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1522 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:605
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2215
msgid "Default extrusion width"
msgstr "默认挤出宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1525
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to allow a manual extrusion width. If left to "
"zero, extrusion widths are derived from the nozzle diameter (see the "
"tooltips for perimeter extrusion width, infill extrusion width etc). If "
"expressed as percentage (for example: 230%), it will be computed over nozzle "
"diameter or layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle "
"size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可允许手动挤出宽度。若保持为零，挤出宽度将根据喷嘴直径推导（参见轮"
"廓挤出宽度、填充挤出宽度等的提示）。若以百分比表示（例如 230%），将根据“相对"
"于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1537 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6868
msgid "Keep fan always on"
msgstr "始终保持风扇打开"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1538
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, fan will never be disabled and will be kept running at "
"least at its minimum speed. Useful for PLA, harmful for ABS."
msgstr ""
"如果启用此功能，风扇将永远不会被禁用，并且将保持至少以最低速度运行。对 PLA 有"
"用，对 ABS 有害。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1543
msgid "Enable fan if layer print time is below"
msgstr "启用风扇，如果图层打印时间低于"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1544
msgid ""
"If layer print time is estimated below this number of seconds, fan will be "
"enabled and its speed will be calculated by interpolating the minimum and "
"maximum speeds."
msgstr ""
"如果图层打印时间估计低于此秒数，则将启用风扇，并通过插值最小和最大速度来计算"
"其速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1546 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4269
msgid "approximate seconds"
msgstr "近似秒"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1553
msgid "Spin-up time"
msgstr "启动时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1554
msgid ""
"Time in milliseconds for the part cooling fan to spin up from 0% to 100%. "
"This enables physics-based fan speed compensation: fan commands are issued "
"earlier so the fan reaches target speed exactly when needed (e.g., at "
"overhang/bridge start). The actual lead time is calculated proportionally "
"based on the speed change magnitude. Set to 0 to disable this feature. "
"Typical values: 300-1000ms for small blower fans, check your fan's datasheet "
"or measure."
msgstr ""
"零件冷却风扇从 0% 加速到 100% 所需的时间（毫秒）。这可启用基于物理的风扇转速"
"补偿：风扇指令会提前发出，使风扇恰好在需要时（例如悬垂/桥接开始处）达到目标转"
"速。实际提前时间根据转速变化幅度按比例计算。设为 0 可禁用此功能。典型值：小型"
"鼓风风扇为 300-1000ms，请查阅风扇数据手册或自行测量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1560
msgid "ms"
msgstr "毫秒"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1568
msgid "Fan response type"
msgstr "风扇响应类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1569
msgid ""
"Acceleration profile of your part cooling fan. Affects how early the fan "
"command is issued.\n"
"• Axial fan: Fast response, typical small axial fans\n"
"• Blower: Moderate response, typical small radial blowers\n"
"• High-inertia: Slow response, high-static-pressure blowers"
msgstr ""
"零件冷却风扇的加速特性。影响风扇指令提前发出的程度。\n"
"• 轴流风扇：响应快，典型的小型轴流风扇\n"
"• 鼓风风扇：响应中等，典型的小型离心鼓风机\n"
"• 高惯量：响应慢，高静压鼓风机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1574
msgid "Axial fan (fast)"
msgstr "轴流风扇（快）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1575
msgid "Blower (moderate)"
msgstr "鼓风风扇（中等）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1577
msgid "High-inertia (slow)"
msgstr "高惯量（慢）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1583
msgid ""
"Enable early fan spin-up before bridge infill. When enabled, the fan command "
"is issued early enough for the fan to reach target speed before the bridge "
"begins. Requires Spin-up time > 0."
msgstr ""
"在桥接填充前启用风扇提前启动。启用后，风扇指令会提前到足以让风扇在桥接开始前"
"达到目标转速。需要启动时间 > 0。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1591
msgid ""
"Enable early fan spin-up before overhang perimeters. When enabled, the fan "
"command is issued early enough for the fan to reach target speed before the "
"overhang begins. Requires Spin-up time > 0."
msgstr ""
"在悬垂轮廓前启用风扇提前启动。启用后，风扇指令会提前到足以让风扇在悬垂开始前"
"达到目标转速。需要启动时间 > 0。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1599
msgid ""
"Enable early fan spin-up before overhanging serpentine extrusions. When "
"enabled, the fan command is issued early enough for the fan to reach target "
"speed before the overhang begins. Requires Spin-up time > 0."
msgstr ""
"在悬垂蛇形挤出前启用风扇提前启动。启用后，风扇指令会提前到足以让风扇在悬垂开"
"始前达到目标转速。需要启动时间 > 0。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1606 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6018
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6808
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1612 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6811
msgid "Transmission distance"
msgstr "透射距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1613
msgid ""
"How deep light penetrates this filament before it appears fully opaque, in "
"millimetres. Lower values = more opaque (the filament's color saturates over "
"a thinner stack of layers). Higher values = more translucent (color builds "
"up gradually as more material stacks on top). Color Mixing uses this to "
"predict the blended color of stacked filament layers, so accurate values "
"produce accurate previews. Measure with the preFlight TD1S sensor for "
"precise results, or leave at the 4.0 default if you have not measured -- "
"this works reasonably for most opaque PLA but can be off for translucent, "
"silk, or specialty filaments."
msgstr ""
"光线在该耗材中渗透多深才显得完全不透明，单位毫米。值越低 = 越不透明（耗材颜色"
"在更薄的层叠中即饱和）。值越高 = 越半透明（颜色随更多材料叠加而逐渐显现）。混"
"色功能用它来预测叠加耗材层的混合颜色，因此准确的值能产生准确的预览。使用 "
"preFlight TD1S 传感器测量可获得精确结果，如未测量可保留默认值 4.0 —— 这对大多"
"数不透明 PLA 效果尚可，但对半透明、丝绸或特殊耗材可能有偏差。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1628
msgid "Filament notes"
msgstr "耗材备注"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1629
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the filament here."
msgstr "你可以把关于耗材的笔记放在这里。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1638 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1649
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3182 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3193
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2050 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6823
msgid "Max volumetric flow"
msgstr "最大体积流量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1639 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1650
msgid ""
"Maximum volumetric flow (mm³/s) this filament can sustain. Used by Auto "
"speed to calculate print move speeds. Also caps all print speeds regardless "
"of Auto speed."
msgstr ""
"该耗材可持续的最大体积流量（mm³/s）。自动速度用它来计算打印移动速度。也会对所"
"有打印速度设上限，无论是否启用自动速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1642 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1653
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1841 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3186
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3197 src/slic3r/GUI/RammingChart.cpp:114
msgid "mm³/s"
msgstr "mm³/s"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1659 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3172
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2051 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6824
msgid "Max print speed"
msgstr "最大打印速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1660
msgid ""
"Overrides the print profile's Max print speed for auto speed calculations. "
"Set to zero to use the print profile's value."
msgstr ""
"覆盖打印配置中用于自动速度计算的最大打印速度。设为零则使用打印配置的值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1668
msgid "Max non-crossing infill speed"
msgstr "最大非交叉填充速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1669
msgid ""
"Maximum speed allowed for this filament while printing infill without any "
"self intersections in a single layer. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr "该耗材在单层内打印无任何自相交填充时允许的最大速度。设为零表示无限制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1678 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6826
msgid "Max crossing infill speed"
msgstr "最大交叉填充速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1679
msgid ""
"Maximum speed allowed for this filament while printing infill with self "
"intersections in a single layer. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr "该耗材在单层内打印有自相交填充时允许的最大速度。设为零表示无限制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1688 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6977
msgid "Loading speed"
msgstr "加载速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1689
msgid "Speed used for loading the filament on the wipe tower."
msgstr "用于在擦料塔上装载耗材的速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1696
msgid "Loading speed at the start"
msgstr "开始时加载速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1697
msgid "Speed used at the very beginning of loading phase."
msgstr "在加载阶段开始时使用的速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1704 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6979
msgid "Unloading speed"
msgstr "卸载速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1705
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the filament on the wipe tower (does not affect  "
"initial part of unloading just after ramming)."
msgstr "用于卸载擦聊塔上的耗材的速度（不影响冲压后卸载的初始部分）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1713
msgid "Unloading speed at the start"
msgstr "开始时卸载速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1714
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the tip of the filament immediately after ramming."
msgstr "冲压后立即卸载耗材尖端的速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1721
msgid "Delay after unloading"
msgstr "卸载后延迟"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1722
msgid ""
"Time to wait after the filament is unloaded. May help to get reliable "
"toolchanges with flexible materials that may need more time to shrink to "
"original dimensions."
msgstr ""
"卸下耗材后等待的时间。通过弹性材料，可能需要更多时间缩小到原始尺寸，有助于获"
"得可靠的挤出机更换。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1725 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1799
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1816 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5911
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5920 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5929
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6087 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6095
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6103 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6110
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6118 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6126
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6460 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6469
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6562 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6579
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6597 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6614
#: src/slic3r/GUI/RammingChart.cpp:108 src/slic3r/GUI/WipeTowerDialog.cpp:151
msgid "s"
msgstr "s"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1731 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6986
msgid "Stamping loading speed"
msgstr "压印装载速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1732
msgid "Speed used for stamping."
msgstr "压印所用的速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1739
msgid "Stamping distance measured from the center of the cooling tube"
msgstr "从冷却管中心测量的压印距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1741
msgid ""
"If set to nonzero value, filament is moved toward the nozzle between the "
"individual cooling moves (\"stamping\"). This option configures how long "
"this movement should be before the filament is retracted again."
msgstr ""
"若设为非零值，则在各次冷却移动之间将耗材推向喷嘴（“压印”）。此选项配置在耗材"
"再次回抽之前该移动应持续多长。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1749
msgid "Number of cooling moves"
msgstr "冷却移动次数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1750
msgid ""
"Filament is cooled by being moved back and forth in the cooling tubes. "
"Specify desired number of these moves."
msgstr "在冷却管中来回移动，使耗材冷却。指定这些移动的所需数量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1758
msgid "Speed of the first cooling move"
msgstr "第一次冷却移动的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1759
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating beginning at this speed."
msgstr "冷却运动正逐渐以这个速度加速。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1766 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6969
msgid "Minimal purge on wipe tower"
msgstr "擦料塔上的最小清理量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1768
msgid ""
"After a tool change, the exact position of the newly loaded filament inside "
"the nozzle may not be known, and the filament pressure is likely not yet "
"stable. Before purging the print head into an infill or a sacrificial "
"object, Slic3r will always prime this amount of material into the wipe tower "
"to produce successive infill or sacrificial object extrusions reliably."
msgstr ""
"换料后, 新加载的耗材在喷嘴内的确切位置可能尚不清楚, 而且耗材压力可能尚不稳"
"定。在将打印头清洗成填充物或填充对象之前,Slic3r 将始终将这些数量的材料放入擦"
"料塔中, 以可靠地产生连续的填充物或填充对象。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1772 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1833
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3404
msgid "mm³"
msgstr "mm³"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1778
msgid "Speed of the last cooling move"
msgstr "上次冷却移动的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1779
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating towards this speed."
msgstr "冷却移动正逐渐加速向此速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1786
msgid "Purge volume multiplier"
msgstr "清料体积倍数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1787
msgid ""
"Purging volume on the wipe tower is determined by 'multimaterial_purging' in "
"Printer Settings. This option allows to modify the volume on filament level. "
"Note that the project can override this by setting project-specific values."
msgstr ""
"擦拭塔上的清料体积由打印机设置中的“multimaterial_purging”决定。此选项允许在耗"
"材层面修改该体积。请注意，项目可通过设置项目专属值来覆盖此项。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1796
msgid "Filament load time"
msgstr "耗材加载时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1798
msgid ""
"Time for the printer firmware (or the Multi Material Unit 2.0) to load a new "
"filament during a tool change (when executing the T code). This time is "
"added to the total print time by the G-code time estimator."
msgstr ""
"打印机固件 (或 Multi Material Unit 2.0) 在工具更换期间 (执行 T 代码时) 加载新"
"耗材的时间。 G-Code 时间估计器将此时间添加到总打印时间中。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1805
msgid "Ramming parameters"
msgstr "冲击参数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1806
msgid ""
"This string is edited by RammingDialog and contains ramming specific "
"parameters."
msgstr "此字符串由 RammingDialog 编辑，包含冲压特定参数。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1813
msgid "Filament unload time"
msgstr "耗材卸载时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1815
msgid ""
"Time for the printer firmware (or the Multi Material Unit 2.0) to unload a "
"filament during a tool change (when executing the T code). This time is "
"added to the total print time by the G-code time estimator."
msgstr ""
"打印机固件 (或 Multi Material Unit 2.0) 在工具更换期间 (执行 T 代码时) 卸载耗"
"材的时间。 G-Code 时间估计器将此时间添加到总打印时间中。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1822
msgid "Enable ramming for multitool setups"
msgstr "为多工具配置启用回填"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1824
msgid ""
"Perform ramming when using multitool printer (i.e. when the 'Single Extruder "
"Multimaterial' in Printer Settings is unchecked). When checked, a small "
"amount of filament is rapidly extruded on the wipe tower just before the "
"toolchange. This option is only used when the wipe tower is enabled."
msgstr ""
"在使用多工具打印机时执行回填（即打印机设置中“单挤出机多材料”未勾选时）。勾选"
"后，会在换头前在擦拭塔上快速挤出少量耗材。此选项仅在启用擦拭塔时使用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1831
msgid "Multitool ramming volume"
msgstr "多工具回填体积"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1832
msgid "The volume to be rammed before the toolchange."
msgstr "换头前要回填的体积。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1839
msgid "Multitool ramming flow"
msgstr "多工具回填流量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1840
msgid "Flow used for ramming the filament before the toolchange."
msgstr "换头前回填耗材所用的流量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1847 src/slic3r/GUI/BedShapeDialog.cpp:56
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoMeasure.cpp:2512
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6812
msgid "Diameter"
msgstr "直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1848
msgid ""
"Enter your filament diameter here. Good precision is required, so use a "
"caliper and do multiple measurements along the filament, then compute the "
"average."
msgstr ""
"在此处输入您的耗材直径。需要比较好的精度，建议使用卡钳沿耗材进行多次测量，然"
"后计算平均值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1855 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6062
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6063 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6814
msgid "Density"
msgstr "密度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1856
msgid ""
"Enter your filament density here. This is only for statistical information. "
"A decent way is to weigh a known length of filament and compute the ratio of "
"the length to volume. Better is to calculate the volume directly through "
"displacement."
msgstr ""
"在此处输入您的耗材密度。这仅用于统计信息。一个方法是称量已知长度的耗材，并计"
"算长度与体积的比率。最好通过位移直接计算体积。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1859
msgid "g/cm³"
msgstr "g/cm³"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1864 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6807
msgid "Filament type"
msgstr "耗材类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1865
msgid "The filament material type for use in custom G-codes."
msgstr "用于自定义 G-Codes 的耗材材料类型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1878 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6809
msgid "Soluble material"
msgstr "可溶性材料"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1879
msgid "Soluble material is most likely used for a soluble support."
msgstr "可溶性材料最有可能用于可溶性支撑。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1884 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6810
msgid "Abrasive material"
msgstr "磨蚀性材料"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1886
msgid ""
"This flag means that the material is abrasive and requires a hardened "
"nozzle. The value is used by the printer to check it."
msgstr "此标志表示材料具有磨蚀性，需要硬化喷嘴。打印机使用此值进行检查。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1891 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6833
msgid "Enable pressure advance"
msgstr "启用压力提前"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1892
msgid ""
"Enable automatic pressure advance command emission for this filament. When "
"enabled, the appropriate firmware command is inserted after the start "
"filament G-code using the value below.\n"
"\n"
"RepRapFirmware: M572 D<extruder> S<value>\n"
"Klipper: SET_PRESSURE_ADVANCE ADVANCE=<value>\n"
"Marlin: M900 K<value>"
msgstr ""
"为该耗材启用自动发出压力提前指令。启用后，将在起始耗材 G-code 之后使用下方的"
"值插入相应的固件指令。\n"
"\n"
"RepRapFirmware：M572 D<extruder> S<value>\n"
"Klipper：SET_PRESSURE_ADVANCE ADVANCE=<value>\n"
"Marlin：M900 K<value>"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1901 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6832
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6834 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:3277
msgid "Pressure advance"
msgstr "压力提前"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1902
msgid ""
"Pressure advance value for this filament. Higher values compensate for more "
"flexible filament or longer Bowden tubes. Typical values range from 0.01 to "
"0.15 for direct drive and 0.3 to 1.0 for Bowden."
msgstr ""
"该耗材的压力提前值。值越高，对更柔软的耗材或更长的鲍登管补偿越多。典型值：直"
"驱为 0.01 到 0.15，鲍登为 0.3 到 1.0。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1909 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6069
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6070 src/slic3r/GUI/GLCanvas3D.cpp:1898
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6815
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "费用"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1910
msgid ""
"Enter your filament cost per kg here. This is only for statistical "
"information."
msgstr "在此处输入每公斤耗材成本。这仅用于统计信息。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1911
msgid "money/kg"
msgstr "元/公斤"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1916 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6816
msgid "Spool weight"
msgstr "线轴重量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1918
msgid ""
"Enter weight of the empty filament spool. One may weigh a partially consumed "
"filament spool before printing and one may compare the measured weight with "
"the calculated weight of the filament with the spool to find out whether the "
"amount of filament on the spool is sufficient to finish the print."
msgstr ""
"输入空耗材滑阀的重量。打印前，可以对部分消耗的耗材线轴进行称重，并将测量重量"
"与耗材与线轴的计算重量进行比较，以确定线轴上的耗材量是否足以完成打印。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1922 src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3196
msgid "g"
msgstr "g"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1931 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6169
msgid "(Unknown)"
msgstr "(未知)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1935
msgid "Shrinkage compensation X"
msgstr "收缩补偿 X"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1936
msgid ""
"Enter your filament shrinkage percentage for the X axis here to apply "
"scaling of the object to compensate for shrinkage in the X axis. For "
"example, if you measured 99mm instead of 100mm, enter 1%."
msgstr ""
"在此输入耗材在 X 轴的收缩百分比，以对物体进行缩放来补偿 X 轴的收缩。例如，如"
"果你测得 99mm 而非 100mm，请输入 1%。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1946
msgid "Shrinkage compensation Y"
msgstr "收缩补偿 Y"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1947
msgid ""
"Enter your filament shrinkage percentage for the Y axis here to apply "
"scaling of the object to compensate for shrinkage in the Y axis. For "
"example, if you measured 99mm instead of 100mm, enter 1%."
msgstr ""
"在此输入耗材在 Y 轴的收缩百分比，以对物体进行缩放来补偿 Y 轴的收缩。例如，如"
"果你测得 99mm 而非 100mm，请输入 1%。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1957
msgid "Shrinkage compensation Z"
msgstr "收缩补偿 Z"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1958
msgid ""
"Enter your filament shrinkage percentages for the Z axis here to apply "
"scaling of the object to compensate for shrinkage in the Z axis. For "
"example, if you measured 99mm instead of 100mm, enter 1%."
msgstr ""
"在此输入耗材在 Z 轴的收缩百分比，以对物体进行缩放来补偿 Z 轴的收缩。例如，如"
"果你测得 99mm 而非 100mm，请输入 1%。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1968 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1891
msgid "Fill angle"
msgstr "填充角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1970
msgid ""
"Default base angle for infill orientation. Cross-hatching will be applied to "
"this. Bridges will be infilled using the best direction Slic3r can detect, "
"so this setting does not affect them."
msgstr ""
"填充方向的默认基本角度。交叉阴影将应用于此。网桥将使用 Slic3r 可以检测到的最"
"佳方向填充，因此此设置不会影响它们。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1981
msgid "Sparse fill density"
msgstr "稀疏填充密度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1983
msgid "Density of sparse infill, expressed in the range 0% - 100%."
msgstr "稀疏填充的密度，取值范围 0% - 100%。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2005
msgid "Sparse fill pattern"
msgstr "稀疏填充图案"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2007
msgid "Fill pattern for sparse infill."
msgstr "稀疏填充的填充图案。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2011 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4836
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:82
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2012
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoColorMixing.cpp:61
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:66
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFuzzySkin.cpp:60
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoSimplify.cpp:100
msgid "Triangles"
msgstr "三角形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2013
msgid "Stars"
msgstr "星形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2014
msgid "Cubic"
msgstr "立方体"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2015
msgid "Line"
msgstr "线"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2017 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4782
msgid "Honeycomb"
msgstr "蜂窝"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2018
msgid "3D Honeycomb"
msgstr "3D 蜂窝"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2019
msgid "Gyroid"
msgstr "螺旋形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2023
msgid "Adaptive Cubic"
msgstr "自适应立方"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2024
msgid "Support Cubic"
msgstr "支撑立方体"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2025
msgid "Lightning"
msgstr "闪电"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2026
msgid "Zig Zag"
msgstr "锯齿形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2030 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1855
msgid "Solid fill pattern"
msgstr "实心填充图案"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2033
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for solid infill (internal solid layers and vertical shells). "
"Does not affect bridges."
msgstr "实心填充的填充图案（内部实心层和垂直壳层）。不影响桥接。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2049 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2068
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2078 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2147
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:4409 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2111
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2266
msgid "First layer"
msgstr "第一层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2050
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for first layer. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for first layer."
msgstr "这是打印机用于第一层的加速。设置为零以禁用第一层的加速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2058
msgid "First object layer over raft interface"
msgstr "筏接口上的第一个对象层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2060
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for first layer of object "
"above raft interface. Set zero to disable acceleration control for first "
"layer of object above raft interface."
msgstr ""
"这是打印机将用于 raft 界面上方第一层对象的加速度。设置为零可禁用筏接口上方第"
"一层物体的加速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2069
msgid "First layer bed temperature"
msgstr "第一层床温"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2070
msgid ""
"Heated build plate temperature for the first layer. Set this to zero to "
"disable bed temperature control commands in the output."
msgstr "第一层加热构建板温度。将此设置为零以禁用输出中的床温控制命令。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2080
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for first "
"layer. You can use this to force fatter extrudates for better adhesion. If "
"expressed as percentage (for example 120%) it will be computed over nozzle "
"diameter or layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle "
"size' setting. If set to zero, it will use the default extrusion width."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置首层的挤出宽度。可用它强制使用更粗的挤出以获得更好的附"
"着。若以百分比表示（例如 120%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直"
"径或层高为基准计算。设为零则使用默认挤出宽度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2092 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:196
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:244 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1710
msgid "First layer height"
msgstr "第一层高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2094
msgid ""
"When printing with very low layer heights, you might still want to print a "
"thicker bottom layer to improve adhesion and tolerance for non perfect build "
"plates."
msgstr ""
"当以非常低的层高度打印时，您可能仍然希望打印较厚的底层，以提高非完美版的附着"
"力和公差。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2102 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2094
msgid "First layer speed"
msgstr "第一层速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2103
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to all "
"the print moves of the first layer, regardless of their type. If expressed "
"as a percentage (for example: 40%) it will scale the default speeds."
msgstr ""
"如果以 mm/s 表示为绝对值，则此速度将应用于第一层的所有打印移动，而不管其类型"
"如何。如果以百分比表示（例如：40%）它将缩放默认速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2113
msgid "First layer solid infill speed"
msgstr "首层实心填充速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2115
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to the "
"solid infill print moves of the first layer. If expressed as a percentage "
"(for example: 40%) it will be a percantage of the solid infill speed (for "
"example: 40% of the solid infill speed). Note that 0 means that the \"First "
"layer speed\" value will be used."
msgstr ""
"若以 mm/s 的绝对值表示，此速度将应用于首层的实心填充打印移动。若以百分比表示"
"（例如 40%），则为实心填充速度的百分比（例如实心填充速度的 40%）。请注意，0 "
"表示将使用“首层速度”值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2126 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2096
msgid "First layer travel speed"
msgstr "首层行程速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2127
msgid ""
"If set to a non-zero value, this speed will be used for travel moves on the "
"first layer. If expressed as a percentage, it will be calculated over the "
"travel speed. Set to 0 to use the normal travel speed on the first layer."
msgstr ""
"若设为非零值，此速度将用于首层的行程移动。若以百分比表示，则以行程速度为基准"
"计算。设为 0 则在首层使用正常行程速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2136
msgid "Speed of object first layer over raft interface"
msgstr "第一层物体在筏板界面上的速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2138
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to all "
"the print moves of the first object layer above raft interface, regardless "
"of their type. If expressed as a percentage (for example: 40%) it will scale "
"the default speeds."
msgstr ""
"如果以毫米/秒的绝对值表示，该速度将应用于 raft 界面上方第一个对象层的所有打印"
"移动，无论其类型如何。如果以百分比（例如：40%）表示，它将缩放默认速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2148
msgid "First layer nozzle temperature"
msgstr "第一层喷嘴温度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2149
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature for the first layer. If you want to control temperature "
"manually during print, set this to zero to disable temperature control "
"commands in the output G-code."
msgstr ""
"第一层的喷嘴温度。如果要在打印期间手动控制温度，请将其设置为零，以禁用输出 G-"
"Code 中的温度控制命令。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2157 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6882
msgid "Full fan speed at layer"
msgstr "层的全风扇速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2159
msgid ""
"Fan speed will be ramped up linearly from zero at layer "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\" to maximum at layer \"full_fan_speed_layer\". "
"\"full_fan_speed_layer\" will be ignored if lower than "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\", in which case the fan will be running at "
"maximum allowed speed at layer \"disable_fan_first_layers\" + 1."
msgstr ""
"风扇速度将从“禁用第一层”的零线性上升到“全风扇速度层”的最大。如果低于“禁用风扇"
"第一层”，则“全风扇速度第一层”将被忽略，在这种情况下，风扇将在“禁用风扇第一"
"层”+1层以最大允许速度运行。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2169
msgid "Fuzzy skin (global)"
msgstr "模糊表皮（全局）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2170 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2193
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2203 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2214
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2223 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2240
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2252 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2264
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2275 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2286
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2299 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2319
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2329 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:183
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1811 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2049
msgid "Fuzzy skin"
msgstr "模糊表皮"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2171
msgid ""
"Applies fuzzy skin to ALL surfaces of the model. Set to 'None' if you only "
"want fuzzy skin on painted areas."
msgstr ""
"对模型的所有表面应用模糊表皮。如果只想在绘制区域使用模糊表皮，请设为“无”。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2174 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigWizard.cpp:431
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigWizard.cpp:663 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigWizard.cpp:1349
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FileArchiveDialog.cpp:307
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FileArchiveDialog.cpp:325
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:132
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:311
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoMeasure.cpp:2500
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Preferences.cpp:701
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2176
msgid "External perimeters (no holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓（无孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2177
msgid "External perimeters +1 (no holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓 +1（无孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2178
msgid "External perimeters +2 (no holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓 +2（无孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2179
msgid "External perimeters +3 (no holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓 +3（无孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2180
msgid "All perimeters (no holes)"
msgstr "所有轮廓（无孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2182
msgid "External perimeters (incl holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓（含孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2183
msgid "External perimeters +1 (incl holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓 +1（含孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2184
msgid "External perimeters +2 (incl holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓 +2（含孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2185
msgid "External perimeters +3 (incl holes)"
msgstr "外轮廓 +3（含孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2186
msgid "All perimeters (incl holes)"
msgstr "所有轮廓（含孔）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2192 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1814
msgid "Fuzzy skin thickness"
msgstr "模糊皮肤厚度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2194
msgid ""
"The maximum distance that each skin point can be offset (both ways), "
"measured perpendicular to the perimeter wall."
msgstr "每个蒙皮点可以偏移的最大距离（双向），垂直于周界墙测量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2202 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1815
msgid "Fuzzy skin point distance"
msgstr "模糊皮肤点距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2205
msgid ""
"Perimeters will be split into multiple segments by inserting Fuzzy skin "
"points. Lowering the Fuzzy skin point distance will increase the number of "
"randomly offset points on the perimeter wall."
msgstr ""
"通过插入模糊皮肤点，周长将被分割成多个部分。降低“模糊皮肤点距离”（Fuzzy skin "
"point distance）将增加周界墙上随机偏移的点的数量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2213
msgid "Fuzzy skin on bottom layer"
msgstr "底层模糊表皮"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2215
msgid ""
"When enabled, fuzzy skin is applied to all layers including the first layer "
"(layer 0). When disabled, fuzzy skin is skipped on the first layer, giving a "
"smooth bottom surface for better bed adhesion while maintaining the fuzzy "
"texture on all other layers."
msgstr ""
"启用后，模糊表皮应用于包括首层（第 0 层）在内的所有层。禁用时，首层跳过模糊表"
"皮，提供光滑的底面以获得更好的热床附着，同时在所有其他层保持模糊纹理。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2222 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1819
msgid "Noise type"
msgstr "噪声类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2224
msgid ""
"Type of noise algorithm to use for fuzzy skin displacement. Classic uses "
"random noise (original behavior). Perlin and Billow create spatially "
"coherent textures. Ridged creates sharp, jagged features. Voronoi creates "
"cell-based patchwork patterns."
msgstr ""
"用于模糊表皮位移的噪声算法类型。Classic 使用随机噪声（原始行为）。Perlin 和 "
"Billow 生成空间上连贯的纹理。Ridged 生成锐利、参差的特征。Voronoi 生成基于单"
"元的拼接图案。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2230
msgid "Classic (Random)"
msgstr "Classic（随机）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2231
msgid "Perlin"
msgstr "Perlin"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2232
msgid "Billow"
msgstr "Billow"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2233
msgid "Ridged Multifractal"
msgstr "Ridged Multifractal"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2234
msgid "Voronoi"
msgstr "Voronoi"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2239 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1820
msgid "Fuzzy skin mode"
msgstr "模糊表皮模式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2241
msgid ""
"How fuzzy skin effect is applied. Displacement offsets the path "
"perpendicular to the surface. Extrusion varies the extrusion width instead. "
"Combined uses both displacement and extrusion variation."
msgstr ""
"模糊表皮效果的应用方式。位移使路径垂直于表面偏移。挤出则改为变化挤出宽度。组"
"合同时使用位移和挤出变化。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2246
msgid "Displacement"
msgstr "位移"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2246
msgid "Extrusion"
msgstr "挤出"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2246
msgid "Combined"
msgstr "组合"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2251
msgid "Feature size"
msgstr "特征尺寸"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2253
msgid ""
"The base size of coherent noise features in mm. Higher values create larger "
"texture features. Only applies to Perlin, Billow, Ridged, and Voronoi noise "
"types."
msgstr ""
"连贯噪声特征的基础尺寸（mm）。值越高，纹理特征越大。仅适用于 Perlin、Billow、"
"Ridged 和 Voronoi 噪声类型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2263
msgid "Noise octaves"
msgstr "噪声倍频"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2265
msgid ""
"Number of noise instances with decreasing feature size that are summed "
"together. More octaves add finer detail but increase computation time. Only "
"applies to Perlin, Billow, and Ridged noise types."
msgstr ""
"将多个特征尺寸递减的噪声实例叠加在一起的数量。倍频越多，细节越精细，但计算时"
"间增加。仅适用于 Perlin、Billow 和 Ridged 噪声类型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2274
msgid "Noise persistence"
msgstr "噪声持续度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2276
msgid ""
"Controls how quickly the amplitude decreases for each successive octave. "
"Lower values result in smoother noise, higher values preserve more fine "
"detail. Only applies to Perlin and Billow noise types."
msgstr ""
"控制每个连续倍频的振幅下降速度。值越低噪声越平滑，值越高保留越多细节。仅适用"
"于 Perlin 和 Billow 噪声类型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2285 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1821
msgid "Point placement"
msgstr "点布置"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2288
msgid ""
"Algorithm used for placing fuzzy skin points along perimeters.\n"
"\n"
"• Standard: Original algorithm, faster but may cut corners at larger point "
"distances.\n"
"• Shape-following: Preserves corner vertices for better accuracy, especially "
"at larger point distances."
msgstr ""
"沿轮廓布置模糊表皮点所用的算法。\n"
"\n"
"• 标准：原始算法，更快，但在较大点距时可能切角。\n"
"• 随形：保留角顶点以提高精度，尤其是在较大点距时。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2292 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2339
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3715 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigWizard.cpp:429
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "标准"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2293
msgid "Shape-following"
msgstr "随形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2298
msgid "Painted fuzzy skin"
msgstr "绘制的模糊表皮"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2300
msgid ""
"Controls which perimeters are affected in PAINTED fuzzy skin areas. This "
"setting only applies when using the paint-on fuzzy skin tool.\n"
"\n"
"• External perimeters: Only the outermost perimeter (perimeter 0).\n"
"• External perimeters +1: External plus 1 inner perimeter (perimeters 0-1).\n"
"• External perimeters +2: External plus 2 inner perimeters (perimeters "
"0-2).\n"
"• External perimeters +3: External plus 3 inner perimeters (perimeters "
"0-3).\n"
"• All perimeters: All perimeters regardless of depth."
msgstr ""
"控制在“绘制的”模糊表皮区域内受影响的轮廓。此设置仅在使用涂绘模糊表皮工具时适"
"用。\n"
"\n"
"• 外轮廓：仅最外层轮廓（轮廓 0）。\n"
"• 外轮廓 +1：外轮廓加 1 条内轮廓（轮廓 0-1）。\n"
"• 外轮廓 +2：外轮廓加 2 条内轮廓（轮廓 0-2）。\n"
"• 外轮廓 +3：外轮廓加 3 条内轮廓（轮廓 0-3）。\n"
"• 所有轮廓：所有轮廓，不论深度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2309
msgid "External perimeters +1"
msgstr "外轮廓 +1"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2310
msgid "External perimeters +2"
msgstr "外轮廓 +2"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2311
msgid "External perimeters +3"
msgstr "外轮廓 +3"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2312
msgid "All perimeters"
msgstr "所有轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2318
msgid "Fuzzy skin on top surfaces"
msgstr "顶面模糊表皮"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2321
msgid ""
"When enabled, fuzzy skin is applied to all painted areas including top "
"surfaces visible from above. When disabled, fuzzy skin is skipped on "
"perimeters that are visible from the top of the print, giving a smooth "
"finish on top layers while maintaining the fuzzy texture on vertical walls."
msgstr ""
"启用后，模糊表皮应用于包括从上方可见的顶面在内的所有绘制区域。禁用时，从打印"
"件顶部可见的轮廓跳过模糊表皮，使顶层获得光滑的表面，同时在垂直壁上保持模糊纹"
"理。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2328 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5176
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1805 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1818
msgid "Visibility detection"
msgstr "可见性检测"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2330
msgid ""
"Controls the sampling interval used to detect visibility boundaries on "
"perimeters. When 'Fuzzy skin on top/bottom surfaces' is disabled, the slicer "
"samples along each perimeter to find where visibility changes (e.g., where a "
"wall meets an internal shelf).\n"
"\n"
"• Precise (1mm): Highest accuracy, checks every 1mm. Best quality at "
"boundaries.\n"
"• Standard (2mm): Good balance of accuracy and speed.\n"
"• Relaxed (4mm): Faster slicing, minor boundary imprecision.\n"
"• Minimal (8mm): Fastest slicing, noticeable imprecision at boundaries.\n"
"\n"
"Lower values increase slicing time but improve accuracy at visibility "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""
"控制用于检测轮廓上可见性边界的采样间隔。当“顶/底面模糊表皮”被禁用时，切片器会"
"沿每条轮廓采样以找出可见性变化处（例如壁与内部台阶相交处）。\n"
"\n"
"• 精确（1mm）：精度最高，每 1mm 检查一次。边界处质量最佳。\n"
"• 标准（2mm）：精度与速度的良好平衡。\n"
"• 宽松（4mm）：切片更快，边界略有不精确。\n"
"• 最低（8mm）：切片最快，边界处有明显不精确。\n"
"\n"
"值越低，切片时间越长，但可见性边界处的精度越高。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2339 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3715
msgid "Precise"
msgstr "精确"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2339 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3715
msgid "Relaxed"
msgstr "宽松"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2345 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2316
msgid "Perimeter compression"
msgstr "轮廓压缩"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2347
msgid ""
"Controls how narrow a center perimeter can be when Athena fills tight wall "
"sections. When full-count perimeters don't quite fit, Athena can squeeze a "
"narrower center bead into the remaining space. This setting determines how "
"thin that center bead is allowed to be. More aggressive compression fills "
"more gaps but produces thinner beads. This setting only applies to the "
"Athena perimeter generator.\n"
"\n"
"• Minimal: Center beads can narrow to 75% of perimeter width\n"
"• Moderate: Center beads can narrow to 50% of perimeter width\n"
"• Aggressive: Center beads can narrow to 25% of perimeter width\n"
"\n"
"The floor is always 33% of nozzle diameter to ensure printability."
msgstr ""
"控制 Athena 填充紧密壁段时中心轮廓可以多窄。当整数条轮廓不太合适时，Athena 可"
"在剩余空间挤入一条更窄的中心挤出。此设置决定该中心挤出允许多薄。压缩越激进，"
"填充的间隙越多，但挤出越薄。此设置仅适用于 Athena 轮廓生成器。\n"
"\n"
"• 最小：中心挤出可窄至轮廓宽度的 75%\n"
"• 中等：中心挤出可窄至轮廓宽度的 50%\n"
"• 激进：中心挤出可窄至轮廓宽度的 25%\n"
"\n"
"下限始终为喷嘴直径的 33%，以确保可打印性。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2357
msgid "Moderate"
msgstr "中等"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2357
msgid "Aggressive"
msgstr "激进"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2375 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2317
msgid "Thin wall width precision"
msgstr "薄壁宽度精度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2377
msgid ""
"Controls the rounding precision for thin wall extrusion widths. Athena "
"measures the actual wall thickness and snaps it to a grid to reduce noise.\n"
"\n"
"Finer values (0.001mm) track tapered geometry more smoothly but may produce "
"visible width variation on constant-thickness walls.\n"
"\n"
"Coarser values (0.1mm) produce consistent widths on uniform walls but step "
"more coarsely on tapered geometry.\n"
"\n"
"This setting only applies to the Athena perimeter generator."
msgstr ""
"控制薄壁挤出宽度的取整精度。Athena 测量实际壁厚并将其对齐到网格以减少噪声。\n"
"\n"
"更精细的值（0.001mm）能更平滑地跟踪锥形几何，但可能在等厚壁上产生可见的宽度变"
"化。\n"
"\n"
"更粗的值（0.1mm）在均匀壁上产生一致的宽度，但在锥形几何上阶跃更粗。\n"
"\n"
"此设置仅适用于 Athena 轮廓生成器。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2385
msgid "0.001 mm"
msgstr "0.001 mm"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2386
msgid "0.005 mm"
msgstr "0.005 mm"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2387
msgid "0.01 mm"
msgstr "0.01 mm"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2388
msgid "0.05 mm"
msgstr "0.05 mm"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2389
msgid "0.1 mm"
msgstr "0.1 mm"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2394 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2352
msgid "Verbose G-code"
msgstr "详细 G-Code"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2395
msgid ""
"Enable this to get a commented G-code file, with each line explained by a "
"descriptive text. If you print from SD card, the additional weight of the "
"file could make your firmware slow down."
msgstr ""
"启用此选项可获取注释的 G-Code 文件，每行都由描述性文本解释。如果从 SD 卡打"
"印，文件的额外权重可能会降低固件速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2402 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3804
msgid "G-code flavor"
msgstr "G-Code 风格"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2403
msgid ""
"Some G/M-code commands, including temperature control and others, are not "
"universal. Set this option to your printer's firmware to get a compatible "
"output. The \"No extrusion\" flavor prevents preFlight from exporting any "
"extrusion value at all."
msgstr ""
"某些 G/M 代码命令（包括温度控制和其他命令）并不通用。将此选项设置为打印机固件"
"以获取兼容输出。\"无挤出\"风格可防止 preFlight 导出任何挤出值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2420
msgid "No extrusion"
msgstr "无挤出"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2425 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2353
msgid "Label objects"
msgstr "标记对象"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2427
msgid ""
"Selects whether labels should be exported at object boundaries and in what "
"format.\n"
"OctoPrint = comments to be consumed by OctoPrint CancelObject plugin.\n"
"Firmware = firmware specific G-code (it will be chosen based on firmware "
"flavor and it can end up to be empty).\n"
"\n"
"This settings is NOT compatible with Single Extruder Multi Material setup "
"and Wipe into Object / Wipe into Infill."
msgstr ""
"选择是否在物体边界处导出标签以及以何种格式导出。\n"
"OctoPrint = 供 OctoPrint CancelObject 插件使用的注释。\n"
"Firmware = 固件专属 G-code（将根据固件风格选择，可能最终为空）。\n"
"\n"
"此设置与单挤出机多材料配置及擦入物体/擦入填充不兼容。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2433
msgid "OctoPrint comments"
msgstr "OctoPrint 注释"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2433
msgid "Firmware-specific"
msgstr "固件专属"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2438
msgid "G-code substitutions"
msgstr "G-Code 替换"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2439
msgid "Find / replace patterns in G-code lines and substitute them."
msgstr "查找/替换 G-Code 行中的模式并替换它们。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2444 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:4035
msgid "High extruder current on filament swap"
msgstr "耗材切换时的高挤出机电流"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2445
msgid ""
"It may be beneficial to increase the extruder motor current during the "
"filament exchange sequence to allow for rapid ramming feed rates and to "
"overcome resistance when loading a filament with an ugly shaped tip."
msgstr ""
"在耗材切换序列中增加挤出机电机电流可能是有益的, 这样可以快速冲击进料速度, 并"
"在用不良形状的尖端加载耗材时克服阻力。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2453
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for infill. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for infill."
msgstr "这是打印机用于填充的加速。设置为零以禁用填充的加速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2462
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for solid infill. Set zero to "
"use the value for infill."
msgstr "这是你的打印机将用于固体填充的加速度。设置为零即可使用该值进行填充。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2471
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for top solid infill. Set "
"zero to use the value for solid infill."
msgstr ""
"这是你的打印机将用于顶部实心填充的加速度。设置为零就可以使用固体填充的数值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2480
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for wipe tower. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for the wipe tower."
msgstr "这是打印机用于擦拭塔的加速度。设为零可禁用擦拭塔的加速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2488 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5236
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:453 src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:3768
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GCodeViewer.cpp:4616 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2086
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2114 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3933
msgid "Travel"
msgstr "旅行"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2489
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for travel moves. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for travel."
msgstr ""
"这是你的打印机在移动时使用的加速度。设置为零是为了禁止对移动的加速度控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2497
msgid "Travel short distance acceleration"
msgstr "短距离行程加速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2499
msgid ""
"Acceleration used for short travel moves. Short travel distance is "
"determined by the retract_before_travel setting."
msgstr ""
"用于短距离行程移动的加速度。短行程距离由 retract_before_travel 设置决定。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2506 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1880
msgid "Combine infill every"
msgstr "合并填充层数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2508
msgid ""
"This feature allows to combine infill and speed up your print by extruding "
"thicker infill layers while preserving thin perimeters, thus accuracy. Note: "
"Combined layer height cannot exceed the nozzle diameter (e.g., with a 0.4mm "
"nozzle and 0.2mm layer height, you can combine up to 2 layers)."
msgstr ""
"此功能可合并填充并通过挤出更厚的填充层来加快打印速度，同时保留较薄的轮廓以保"
"持精度。注意：合并后的层高不能超过喷嘴直径（例如，使用 0.4mm 喷嘴和 0.2mm 层"
"高时，最多可合并 2 层）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2513
msgid "Combine infill every n layers"
msgstr "混合填充每 n 个层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2519
msgid "Length of the infill anchor"
msgstr "填充锚点的长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2522
msgid ""
"Connect an infill line to an internal perimeter with a short segment of an "
"additional perimeter. If expressed as percentage (example: 15%) it is "
"calculated over infill extrusion width. preFlight tries to connect two close "
"infill lines to a short perimeter segment. If no such perimeter segment "
"shorter than infill_anchor_max is found, the infill line is connected to a "
"perimeter segment at just one side and the length of the perimeter segment "
"taken is limited to this parameter, but no longer than anchor_length_max. "
"Set this parameter to zero to disable anchoring perimeters connected to a "
"single infill line."
msgstr ""
"用附加周长的一小段将填充线连接到内部周长。如果以百分比（例如：15%）表示，则计"
"算填充拉伸宽度。preFlight 试图将两条紧密的填充线连接到一个短的周长段。如果找"
"不到短于“填充”和“锚点”最大值的周长线段，则填充线仅在一侧连接到周长线段，并且"
"所取周长线段的长度仅限于此参数，但不超过“锚点长度”最大值。将此参数设置为零，"
"以禁用连接到单个填充线的锚点周长。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2533
msgid "0 (no open anchors)"
msgstr "0 (没有锚点)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2534 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2558
msgid "1 mm"
msgstr "1 毫米"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2535 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2559
msgid "2 mm"
msgstr "2 毫米"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2536 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2560
msgid "5 mm"
msgstr "5 毫米"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2537 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2561
msgid "10 mm"
msgstr "10 毫米"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2538 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2562
msgid "1000 (unlimited)"
msgstr "1000 (不限)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2543
msgid "Maximum length of the infill anchor"
msgstr "填充锚点的最大长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2546
msgid ""
"Connect an infill line to an internal perimeter with a short segment of an "
"additional perimeter. If expressed as percentage (example: 15%) it is "
"calculated over infill extrusion width. preFlight tries to connect two close "
"infill lines to a short perimeter segment. If no such perimeter segment "
"shorter than this parameter is found, the infill line is connected to a "
"perimeter segment at just one side and the length of the perimeter segment "
"taken is limited to infill_anchor, but no longer than this parameter. Set "
"this parameter to zero to disable anchoring."
msgstr ""
"用附加周长的一小段将填充线连接到内部周长。如果以百分比（例如：15%）表示，则计"
"算填充拉伸宽度。preFlight 试图将两条紧密的填充线连接到一个短的周长段。如果找"
"不到比此参数短的周长线段，则填充线仅在一侧连接到周长线段，并且所采用的周长线"
"段的长度仅限于 infl_anchor，但不超过此参数。将此参数设置为零以禁用锚点。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2557
msgid "0 (not anchored)"
msgstr "0 (没有锚点)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2567 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2147
msgid "Infill extruder"
msgstr "填充挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2569
msgid "The extruder to use when printing infill."
msgstr "打印填充时要使用的挤出机。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2578
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for infill. If "
"left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, otherwise 1.125 x "
"nozzle diameter will be used. You may want to use fatter extrudates to speed "
"up the infill and make your parts stronger. If expressed as percentage (for "
"example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, "
"depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置填充的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已设"
"置），否则使用 1.125 倍喷嘴直径。你可能希望使用更粗的挤出以加快填充并使零件更"
"牢固。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴"
"直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2589 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1897
msgid "Infill before perimeters"
msgstr "在填充前先打印轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2590
msgid ""
"This option will switch the print order of perimeters and infill, making the "
"latter first."
msgstr "此选项将切换轮廓和填充的打印顺序，使后者首先进行。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2604
msgid "Ext. perimeter/perimeter overlap"
msgstr "外轮廓/轮廓重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2606
msgid ""
"Controls overlap between external perimeter and first inner perimeter. "
"Extruded beads have rounded edges that must overlap for proper bonding. The "
"default 10.73% is derived from the geometric constant (1 - π/4) / 2, which "
"accounts for the semicircular bead cross-section. The overlap amount is "
"calculated from layer height: at 10.73%, beads bond optimally; at 100%, "
"beads completely overlap. Requires at least 2 perimeters."
msgstr ""
"控制外轮廓与第一条内轮廓之间的重叠。挤出的挤出线边缘呈圆形，必须重叠才能正确"
"粘合。默认 10.73% 源自几何常数 (1 - π/4) / 2，它考虑了半圆形挤出线截面。重叠"
"量根据层高计算：10.73% 时挤出线粘合最佳；100% 时挤出线完全重叠。需要至少 2 条"
"轮廓。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2618 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:376
msgid "Perimeter/perimeter overlap"
msgstr "轮廓/轮廓重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2620
msgid ""
"Controls overlap between all internal perimeters. Extruded beads have "
"rounded edges that must overlap for proper bonding. The default 10.73% is "
"derived from the geometric constant (1 - π/4) / 2, which accounts for the "
"semicircular bead cross-section. The overlap amount is calculated from layer "
"height: at 10.73%, beads bond optimally; at 100%, beads completely overlap. "
"Requires at least 3 perimeters. Maximum 80%."
msgstr ""
"控制所有内轮廓之间的重叠。挤出的挤出线边缘呈圆形，必须重叠才能正确粘合。默认 "
"10.73% 源自几何常数 (1 - π/4) / 2，它考虑了半圆形挤出线截面。重叠量根据层高计"
"算：10.73% 时挤出线粘合最佳；100% 时挤出线完全重叠。需要至少 3 条轮廓。最大 "
"80%。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2632 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:380
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2285
msgid "Infill/perimeters overlap"
msgstr "填充/轮廓重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2634
msgid ""
"Controls overlap between infill and the innermost perimeter. Extruded beads "
"have rounded edges that must overlap for proper bonding. The default 21.46% "
"is derived from the geometric constant (1 - π/4), which accounts for the "
"semicircular bead cross-section. The overlap amount is calculated from layer "
"height. Higher values may cause over-extrusion artifacts."
msgstr ""
"控制填充与最内层轮廓之间的重叠。挤出的挤出线边缘呈圆形，必须重叠才能正确粘"
"合。默认 21.46% 源自几何常数 (1 - π/4)，它考虑了半圆形挤出线截面。重叠量根据"
"层高计算。值过高可能导致过挤出瑕疵。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2645 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:388
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2288
msgid "Bridge infill overlap"
msgstr "桥接填充重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2647
msgid ""
"Controls overlap between adjacent bridge infill lines. At 0% (default), "
"lines touch edge-to-edge. Positive values create overlap (lines print "
"closer, may help lines support each other). Negative values create gaps "
"between lines. The overlap amount is calculated from layer height."
msgstr ""
"控制相邻桥接填充线之间的重叠。0%（默认）时，线条边对边相接。正值产生重叠（线"
"条打印得更近，可能有助于线条相互支撑）。负值在线条间产生间隙。重叠量根据层高"
"计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2662 src/slic3r/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:384
msgid "Bridge infill/perimeters overlap"
msgstr "桥接填充/轮廓重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2664
msgid ""
"Controls overlap between bridge infill and the innermost perimeter. Separate "
"from 'Infill/perimeters overlap' which affects normal infill. Extruded beads "
"have rounded edges that must overlap for proper bonding. The default 21.46% "
"is derived from the geometric constant (1 - π/4), which accounts for the "
"semicircular bead cross-section. The overlap amount is calculated from layer "
"height. At 0%, edges touch. Negative values create gaps."
msgstr ""
"控制桥接填充与最内层轮廓之间的重叠。与影响普通填充的“填充/轮廓重叠”分开。挤出"
"的挤出线边缘呈圆形，必须重叠才能正确粘合。默认 21.46% 源自几何常数 (1 - π/"
"4)，它考虑了半圆形挤出线截面。重叠量根据层高计算。0% 时边缘相接。负值产生间"
"隙。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2680
msgid "Speed for printing the internal fill. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr "打印内部填充的速度。零为自动设置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2688
msgid "Inherits profile"
msgstr "继承配置文件"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2689
msgid "Name of the profile, from which this profile inherits."
msgstr "此配置文件从中继承的配置文件的名称。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2702 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2184
msgid "Interface shells"
msgstr "接触面外壳"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2703
msgid ""
"Force the generation of solid shells between adjacent materials/volumes. "
"Useful for multi-extruder prints with translucent materials or manual "
"soluble support material."
msgstr ""
"强制在相邻材料/体积之间生成固体壳。适用于具有半透明材料或手动可溶性支撑材料的"
"多挤出机打印。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2711
msgid "Maximum width of a segmented region"
msgstr "分段区域的最大宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2712
msgid "Maximum width of a segmented region. Zero disables this feature."
msgstr "分段区域的最大宽度。零将禁用此功能。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2713 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2724
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3944 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3953
msgid "mm (zero to disable)"
msgstr "mm (0 禁用)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2720
msgid "Interlocking depth of a segmented region"
msgstr "分段区域的互锁深度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2721
msgid ""
"Interlocking depth of a segmented region. It will be ignored if "
"\"mmu_segmented_region_max_width\" is zero or if "
"\"mmu_segmented_region_interlocking_depth\"is bigger then "
"\"mmu_segmented_region_max_width\". Zero disables this feature."
msgstr ""
"分段区域的互锁深度。如果“mmu_segmented_region_max_width”为零，"
"或“mmu_segmented_region_interlocking_depth”大"
"于“mmu_segmented_region_max_width”，则将忽略此项。设为零可禁用此功能。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2731 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1866
msgid "Enable ironing"
msgstr "启用熨烫"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2732
msgid ""
"Enable ironing of the top layers with the hot print head for smooth surface"
msgstr "使用热打印头熨烫顶层，使表面光滑"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2738
msgid "Use beam interlocking"
msgstr "使用梁互锁"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2740
msgid ""
"Generate interlocking beam structure at the locations where different "
"filaments touch. This improves the adhesion between filaments, especially "
"models printed in different materials."
msgstr ""
"在不同耗材接触的位置生成互锁梁结构。这能改善耗材之间的附着，尤其是用不同材料"
"打印的模型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2746
msgid "Interlocking beam width"
msgstr "互锁梁宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2747
msgid "The width of the interlocking structure beams."
msgstr "互锁结构梁的宽度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2755
msgid "Interlocking direction"
msgstr "互锁方向"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2756
msgid "Orientation of interlocking beams."
msgstr "互锁梁的取向。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2765
msgid "Interlocking beam layers"
msgstr "互锁梁层数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2767
msgid ""
"The height of the beams of the interlocking structure, measured in number of "
"layers. Less layers is stronger, but more prone to defects."
msgstr "互锁结构梁的高度，以层数计量。层数越少越牢固，但更易出现缺陷。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2774 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2192
msgid "Interlocking depth"
msgstr "互锁深度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2776
msgid ""
"The distance from the boundary between filaments to generate interlocking "
"structure, measured in cells. Too few cells will result in poor adhesion."
msgstr ""
"从耗材之间的边界生成互锁结构的距离，以单元计量。单元过少会导致附着不良。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2783
msgid "Interlocking boundary avoidance"
msgstr "互锁边界避让"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2785
msgid ""
"The distance from the outside of a model where interlocking structures will "
"not be generated, measured in cells."
msgstr "模型外侧不生成互锁结构的距离，以单元计量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2792 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2794
msgid "Ironing Type"
msgstr "熨烫类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2796
msgid "All solid surfaces"
msgstr "所有实心表面"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2801 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1868
msgid "Flow rate"
msgstr "流量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2803
msgid "Percent of a flow rate relative to object's normal layer height."
msgstr "相对于对象正常层高度的流速百分比。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2811
msgid "Spacing between ironing passes"
msgstr "熨烫工序之间的间距"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2813
msgid "Distance between ironing lines"
msgstr "熨烫线之间的距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2822
msgid "Speed for ironing top surfaces."
msgstr "熨烫顶面的速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2830
msgid ""
"This custom code is inserted at every layer change, right after the Z move "
"and before the extruder moves to the first layer point. Note that you can "
"use placeholder variables for all Slic3r settings as well as [layer_num] and "
"[layer_z]."
msgstr ""
"此自定义代码在每次图层更改时插入，即 Z 移动之后和挤出机移动到第一个图层点之"
"前。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 Slic3r 设置以及 [layer_num] 和 "
"[layer_z]。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2841 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3807
msgid "Supports remaining times"
msgstr "支持剩余时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2842
msgid ""
"Emit M73 P[percent printed] R[remaining time in minutes] at 1 minute "
"intervals into the G-code to let the firmware show accurate remaining time. "
"Some firmware (like Marlin) recognizes M73 for progress reporting. Also the "
"i3 MK3 firmware supports M73 Qxx Sxx for the silent mode."
msgstr ""
"以 1 分钟间隔向 G-code 发出 M73 P[已打印百分比] R[剩余时间（分钟）]，让固件显"
"示准确的剩余时间。某些固件（如 Marlin）识别 M73 用于进度报告。此外，i3 MK3 固"
"件支持 M73 Qxx Sxx 用于静音模式。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2850 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3806
msgid "Supports stealth mode"
msgstr "支持隐身模式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2851
msgid "The firmware supports stealth mode"
msgstr "固件支持隐身模式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2856
msgid "Supports binary G-code"
msgstr "支持二进制 G-code"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2858
msgid ""
"Enable, if the firmware supports binary G-code format (bgcode). To "
"generate .bgcode files, make sure you have binary G-code enabled in "
"Configuration->Preferences->Other."
msgstr ""
"如果固件支持二进制 G-code 格式（bgcode），请启用。要生成 .bgcode 文件，请确保"
"在“配置->首选项->其他”中已启用二进制 G-code。"

