msgid "Minimum feedrate when extruding (M205 S)"
msgstr "挤出时的最小进给率 (M205S)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2958
msgid "Minimum travel feedrate"
msgstr "最小移动进给率"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2960
msgid "Minimum travel feedrate (M205 T)"
msgstr "最小移动进给率 (M205T)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2968 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3949
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3951 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:4679
msgid "Junction deviation"
msgstr "拐点偏差"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2970
msgid ""
"Junction deviation for Marlin 2.x firmware (M205 J).\n"
"\n"
"When set to a value greater than 0, the slicer will use the junction "
"deviation algorithm instead of classic jerk for time estimation and will "
"output M205 J in the G-code.\n"
"\n"
"Junction deviation provides more accurate cornering speed calculations by "
"allowing the toolhead to deviate from the ideal path by this distance at "
"corners.\n"
"\n"
"Typical values: 0.01 - 0.08 mm\n"
"Set to 0 to use classic jerk (M205 XYZE)."
msgstr ""
"用于 Marlin 2.x 固件的拐点偏差（M205 J）。\n"
"\n"
"当设为大于 0 的值时，切片器将使用拐点偏差算法而非经典 jerk 进行时间估算，并"
"在 G-code 中输出 M205 J。\n"
"\n"
"拐点偏差通过允许工具头在拐角处偏离理想路径此距离，提供更准确的过弯速度计"
"算。\n"
"\n"
"典型值：0.01 - 0.08 mm\n"
"设为 0 则使用经典 jerk（M205 XYZE）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2986 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3989
msgid "M566 (Jerk)"
msgstr "M566（Jerk）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2988
msgid ""
"Enter your M566 command from config.g.\n"
"\n"
"Sets jerk (instantaneous speed change) limits in mm/min.\n"
"The P parameter controls jerk policy:\n"
"  P0 (default): Jerk only between consecutive extrusion or travel moves\n"
"  P1: Marlin-like behavior (jerk between any moves)\n"
"\n"
"Default: M566 X900 Y900 Z600 E300 P0"
msgstr ""
"输入 config.g 中的 M566 指令。\n"
"\n"
"设置 jerk（瞬时速度变化）限制，单位 mm/min。\n"
"P 参数控制 jerk 策略：\n"
"  P0（默认）：仅在连续的挤出或行程移动之间使用 jerk\n"
"  P1：类 Marlin 行为（任意移动之间均使用 jerk）\n"
"\n"
"默认值：M566 X900 Y900 Z600 E300 P0"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2998
msgid "M201 (Max Accel)"
msgstr "M201（最大加速度）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3000
msgid ""
"Enter your M201 command from config.g.\n"
"\n"
"Sets maximum acceleration per axis in mm/s².\n"
"\n"
"Default: M201 X1000 Y1000 Z200 E500"
msgstr ""
"输入 config.g 中的 M201 指令。\n"
"\n"
"设置每轴最大加速度，单位 mm/s²。\n"
"\n"
"默认值：M201 X1000 Y1000 Z200 E500"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3007
msgid "M203 (Max Speed)"
msgstr "M203（最大速度）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3009
msgid ""
"Enter your M203 command from config.g.\n"
"\n"
"Sets maximum feedrate per axis in mm/min (NOT mm/sec!).\n"
"\n"
"Default: M203 X6000 Y6000 Z1200 E6000"
msgstr ""
"输入 config.g 中的 M203 指令。\n"
"\n"
"设置每轴最大进给率，单位 mm/min（不是 mm/sec！）。\n"
"\n"
"默认值：M203 X6000 Y6000 Z1200 E6000"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3016
msgid "M204 (Accel)"
msgstr "M204（加速度）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3018
msgid ""
"Enter your M204 command from config.g (optional).\n"
"\n"
"Sets print and travel acceleration in mm/s².\n"
"  P = Print acceleration (with extrusion)\n"
"  T = Travel acceleration (without extrusion)\n"
"\n"
"Optional - leave blank to let the M201 per-axis limits govern."
msgstr ""
"输入 config.g 中的 M204 指令（可选）。\n"
"\n"
"设置打印和行程加速度，单位 mm/s²。\n"
"  P = 打印加速度（带挤出）\n"
"  T = 行程加速度（不带挤出）\n"
"\n"
"可选 — 留空则由 M201 的各轴限制来控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3027
msgid "M207 (Retract)"
msgstr "M207（回抽）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3029
msgid ""
"Enter your M207 command from config.g (optional).\n"
"\n"
"Sets firmware retraction parameters:\n"
"  S = Retract length (mm)\n"
"  F = Retract feedrate (mm/min)\n"
"  T = Unretract feedrate (mm/min)\n"
"  Z = Z-lift during retract (mm)\n"
"  R = Extra unretract length (mm)\n"
"\n"
"Optional - leave blank if not using firmware retraction (G10/G11)."
msgstr ""
"输入 config.g 中的 M207 指令（可选）。\n"
"\n"
"设置固件回抽参数：\n"
"  S = 回抽长度（mm）\n"
"  F = 回抽进给率（mm/min）\n"
"  T = 回抽恢复进给率（mm/min）\n"
"  Z = 回抽时的 Z 抬升（mm）\n"
"  R = 额外回抽恢复长度（mm）\n"
"\n"
"可选 — 如果不使用固件回抽（G10/G11）则留空。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3042
msgid "Max velocity"
msgstr "最大速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3044
msgid ""
"Maximum velocity from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"This is the global velocity limit for all moves.\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT VELOCITY=<value>"
msgstr ""
"来自 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 段的最大速度。\n"
"\n"
"这是所有移动的全局速度限制。\n"
"\n"
"可在打印中途更改：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT VELOCITY=<value>"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3054
msgid "Max acceleration"
msgstr "最大加速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3056
msgid ""
"Maximum acceleration from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"This is the global acceleration limit for all moves.\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT ACCEL=<value>\n"
"  M204 S<value>"
msgstr ""
"来自 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 段的最大加速度。\n"
"\n"
"这是所有移动的全局加速度限制。\n"
"\n"
"可在打印中途更改：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT ACCEL=<value>\n"
"  M204 S<value>"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3067
msgid "Square corner velocity"
msgstr "方角速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3069
msgid ""
"Square corner velocity from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"Controls how fast the toolhead moves through corners.\n"
"Higher values allow faster cornering but may cause ringing.\n"
"Klipper default is 5.0 mm/s.\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY=<value>"
msgstr ""
"来自 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 段的方角速度。\n"
"\n"
"控制工具头通过拐角的速度。\n"
"值越高过弯越快，但可能导致振纹。\n"
"Klipper 默认值为 5.0 mm/s。\n"
"\n"
"可在打印中途更改：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY=<value>"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3081
msgid "Minimum cruise ratio"
msgstr "最小巡航比"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3083
msgid ""
"Minimum cruise ratio from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"On short moves, the printer maintains at least this fraction\n"
"of the requested speed instead of decelerating fully.\n"
"Klipper default is 0.5 (50% of nominal speed).\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT MINIMUM_CRUISE_RATIO=<value>"
msgstr ""
"来自 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 段的最小巡航比。\n"
"\n"
"在短移动中，打印机至少保持请求速度的此比例\n"
"而不是完全减速。\n"
"Klipper 默认值为 0.5（标称速度的 50%）。\n"
"\n"
"可在打印中途更改：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT MINIMUM_CRUISE_RATIO=<value>"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3095
msgid "Real-World Compensation"
msgstr "真实世界补偿"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3097
msgid ""
"Adjusts time estimates to better match real-world print times.\n"
"\n"
"Negative values increase the estimate (more conservative).\n"
"Positive values decrease the estimate (more aggressive).\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  -15% = Estimate will be 15% longer (recommended starting point)\n"
"  0% = No adjustment (pure physics calculation)\n"
"  +10% = Estimate will be 10% shorter\n"
"\n"
"Adjust based on how your actual prints compare to estimates."
msgstr ""
"调整时间估算以更好地匹配真实世界的打印时间。\n"
"\n"
"负值会增大估算值（更保守）。\n"
"正值会减小估算值（更激进）。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  -15% = 估算值将延长 15%（推荐起点）\n"
"  0% = 不调整（纯物理计算）\n"
"  +10% = 估算值将缩短 10%\n"
"\n"
"根据实际打印与估算的对比情况进行调整。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3113 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3115
msgid "Maximum acceleration when extruding"
msgstr "挤出时的最大加速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3123
msgid "Maximum acceleration when retracting"
msgstr "回抽时的最大加速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3125
msgid ""
"Maximum acceleration when retracting.\n"
"\n"
"Not used for RepRapFirmware, which does not support it."
msgstr ""
"缩回时的最大加速度。\n"
"\n"
"不用于RepRapFirmware，该软件不支持它。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3134
msgid "Maximum acceleration for travel moves"
msgstr "移动时的最大加速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3136
msgid "Maximum acceleration for travel moves."
msgstr "行进移动时的最大加速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3143 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3152
msgid "Max"
msgstr "最大"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3144
msgid "This setting represents the maximum speed of your fan."
msgstr "此设置表示风扇的最大速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3153
msgid ""
"This is the highest printable layer height for this extruder, used to cap "
"the variable layer height and support layer height. Maximum recommended "
"layer height is 75% of the extrusion width to achieve reasonable inter-layer "
"adhesion. If set to 0, layer height is limited to 75% of the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"这是此挤出机的最高可打印层高度，用于盖住可变图层高度和支撑层高度。建议的最大"
"层高度为挤出宽度的 75%，以实现合理的层间粘附。如果设置为 0，则层高度限制为喷"
"嘴直径的 75%。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3163 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2049
msgid "Auto speed"
msgstr "自动速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3164
msgid ""
"When enabled, print move speeds are automatically calculated from each "
"filament's max volumetric flow and capped at Max print speed. Bridge and "
"small perimeter speeds remain manual (set to 0 for auto speed). Over-bridge "
"set to 0 uses solid infill speed. Gap fill set to 0 disables it."
msgstr ""
"启用后，打印移动速度会根据每种耗材的最大体积流量自动计算，并以最大打印速度为"
"上限。桥接和小轮廓速度仍为手动（设为 0 则自动速度）。桥接之上设为 0 则使用实"
"心填充速度。间隙填充设为 0 则禁用它。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3173
msgid ""
"The maximum speed for any print move when using auto speed, or the fallback "
"speed when individual speeds are set to 0."
msgstr ""
"使用自动速度时任何打印移动的最大速度，或当各项速度设为 0 时的后备速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3183 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3194
msgid ""
"Print-level cap on volumetric flow. When greater than zero, it clamps each "
"filament's Max volumetric flow if this value is lower, limiting auto speed "
"accordingly. Set to 0 to rely solely on the filament's Max volumetric flow."
msgstr ""
"打印级别的体积流量上限。当大于零时，如果该值更低，则限制每种耗材的最大体积流"
"量，并相应地限制自动速度。设为0以仅依赖耗材的最大体积流量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3203
msgid "Max volumetric slope positive"
msgstr "最大流量增加率"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3204
msgid ""
"This experimental setting is used to limit the speed of change in extrusion "
"rate for a transition from lower speed to higher speed. A value of 1.8 mm³/"
"s² ensures, that a change from the extrusion rate of 1.8 mm³/s (0.45 mm "
"extrusion width, 0.2 mm extrusion height, feedrate 20 mm/s) to 5.4 mm³/s "
"(feedrate 60 mm/s) will take at least 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"该实验设置用于限制挤出速率的变化速度，以便从较低速度过渡到较高速度。1.8 mm³/"
"s² 的值可确保挤出速率从 1.8 mm³/s（挤出宽度 0.45 mm，挤出高度 0.2 mm，进给速"
"率 20 mm/s）变为 5.4 mm³/s（进给速率 60 mm/s） 至少需要 2 秒。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3209 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3221
msgid "mm³/s²"
msgstr "mm³/s²"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3215
msgid "Max volumetric slope negative"
msgstr "最大流量减少率"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3216
msgid ""
"This experimental setting is used to limit the speed of change in extrusion "
"rate for a transition from higher speed to lower speed. A value of 1.8 mm³/"
"s² ensures, that a change from the extrusion rate of 5.4 mm³/s (0.45 mm "
"extrusion width, 0.2 mm extrusion height, feedrate 60 mm/s) to 1.8 mm³/s "
"(feedrate 20 mm/s) will take at least 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"该实验设置用于限制挤出速率的变化速度，以便从较高速度过渡到较低速度。1.8 mm³/"
"s² 的值可确保挤出速率从 5.4 mm³/s（挤出宽度 0.45 mm，挤出高度 0.2 mm，进给速"
"率 60 mm/s）变为 1.8 mm³/s（进给速率 20 mm/s） 至少需要 2 秒。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3227 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3236
msgid "Min"
msgstr "最小"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3228
msgid "This setting represents the minimum PWM your fan needs to work."
msgstr "此设置表示风扇工作所需的最小 PWM。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3237
msgid ""
"This is the lowest printable layer height for this extruder and limits the "
"resolution for variable layer height. Typical values are between 0.05 mm and "
"0.1 mm."
msgstr ""
"这是此挤出机的最低可打印图层高度，并限制了可变图层高度的分辨率。典型值介于 "
"0.05mm 和 0.1mm 之间。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3245 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6934
msgid "Min print speed"
msgstr "最小打印速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3246
msgid "Slic3r will not scale speed down below this speed."
msgstr "Slic3r 不会将速度降低到低于此速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3253
msgid "Minimal filament extrusion length"
msgstr "最小耗材挤出长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3254
msgid ""
"Generate no less than the number of skirt loops required to consume the "
"specified amount of filament on the bottom layer. For multi-extruder "
"machines, this minimum applies to each extruder."
msgstr ""
"生成不低于在底层消耗指定数量的耗材所需的裙圈数。对于多挤出机,此最小值适用于每"
"个挤出机。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3263
msgid "Configuration notes"
msgstr "配置说明"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3264
msgid ""
"You can put here your personal notes. This text will be added to the G-code "
"header comments."
msgstr "你可以把个人笔记放在这里。此文本将添加到 G-Code 标题注释中。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3273
msgid "Custom print parameters"
msgstr "自定义打印参数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3275
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"JSON-encoded string defining extra parameters, which can later be expanded "
"in Custom G-code macro language. Each of the parameters is prepended by %1% "
"prefix before it is passed into the parser. For example, defining "
"'{\"my_key\": \"my_value\"}' allows to use '%1%_my_key'.\n"
"\n"
"The JSON must be single level (no arrays and objects). All value types are "
"allowed, but nulls will be rejected by the parser."
msgstr ""
"以 JSON 编码的字符串，定义额外参数，之后可在自定义 G-code 宏语言中展开。每个"
"参数在传入解析器之前都会加上 %1% 前缀。例如，定义 '{\"my_key\": "
"\"my_value\"}' 后即可使用 '%1%_my_key'。\n"
"\n"
"JSON 必须为单层（不含数组和对象）。允许所有值类型，但解析器会拒绝 null。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3288
msgid "Print nozzle diameters"
msgstr "打印喷嘴直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3290
msgid ""
"Nozzle diameters for this print profile. When set, these values override the "
"printer's nozzle diameters."
msgstr "此打印配置的喷嘴直径。设置后，这些值会覆盖打印机的喷嘴直径。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3298 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3992
msgid "High flow nozzle"
msgstr "高流量喷嘴"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3299
msgid "Print preset-specific high flow nozzle settings"
msgstr "打印预设专属的高流量喷嘴设置"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3304
msgid "Nozzle diameter"
msgstr "喷嘴直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3305
msgid ""
"This is the diameter of your extruder nozzle (for example: 0.5, 0.35 etc.)"
msgstr "这是挤出机喷嘴的直径（例如：0.5、0.35 等）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3310
msgid "Width warning min"
msgstr "宽度警告下限"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3320
msgid "Width warning max"
msgstr "宽度警告上限"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3333
msgid "Host Type"
msgstr "主机类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3334
msgid ""
"Slic3r can upload G-code files to a printer host. This field must contain "
"the kind of the host."
msgstr "Slic3r 可以将 G-Code 文件上传到打印机主机。此字段必须包含主机的类型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3351 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1896
msgid "Only retract when crossing perimeters"
msgstr "仅在跨越轮廓时回抽"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3352
msgid ""
"Disables retraction when the travel path does not exceed the upper layer's "
"perimeters (and thus any ooze will be probably invisible)."
msgstr "当打印路径不超出前一层的轮廓时（此时任何渗出物不可见），禁用回抽。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3358 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5313
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2160 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2168
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6867 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:3302
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

#. TRN PrintSettings: Enable ooze prevention
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3360
msgid ""
"This option will drop the temperature of the inactive extruders to prevent "
"oozing."
msgstr "此选项将降低非活动挤出机的温度，以防止渗出。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3365 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2354
msgid "Output filename format"
msgstr "输出文件名格式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3366
msgid ""
"You can use all configuration options as variables inside this template. For "
"example: [layer_height], [fill_density] etc. You can also use [timestamp], "
"[year], [month], [day], [hour], [minute], [second], [version], "
"[input_filename_base], [default_output_extension]."
msgstr ""
"你可以在此模板中将所有配置选项用作变量。例如：[layer_height]、[fill_density] "
"等。你还可以使用 [timestamp]、[year]、[month]、[day]、[hour]、[minute]、"
"[second]、[version]、[input_filename_base]、[default_output_extension]。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3375 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1776
msgid "Detect bridging perimeters"
msgstr "检测桥接轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3377
msgid ""
"Experimental option to adjust flow for overhangs (bridge flow will be used), "
"to apply bridge speed to them and enable fan."
msgstr "用于调整悬伸的流量（将使用桥流）的实验选项，以应用桥速并启用风扇。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3383 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:4031
msgid "Filament parking position"
msgstr "耗材停车位"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3384
msgid ""
"Distance of the extruder tip from the position where the filament is parked "
"when unloaded. This should match the value in printer firmware."
msgstr "卸载时，挤出机尖端与耗材停放位置的距离。这应该与打印机固件中的值匹配。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3392 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:4032
msgid "Extra loading distance"
msgstr "额外装载距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3393
msgid ""
"When set to zero, the distance the filament is moved from parking position "
"during load is exactly the same as it was moved back during unload. When "
"positive, it is loaded further,  if negative, the loading move is shorter "
"than unloading."
msgstr ""
"当设置为零时，耗材在负载期间与停车位置移动的距离与卸载期间移回的距离完全相"
"同。当为正时，它进一步加载，如果为负，加载移动比卸载短。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3401 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:4033
msgid "Purging volume"
msgstr "清料体积"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3402
msgid ""
"Determines purging volume on the wipe tower. This can be modified in "
"Filament Settings ('filament_purge_multiplier') or overridden using project-"
"specific settings."
msgstr ""
"决定擦拭塔上的清料体积。可在耗材设置中修改（“filament_purge_multiplier”），或"
"使用项目专属设置覆盖。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3409 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3434
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3449 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3459
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1719 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2058
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2106 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2267
msgid "Perimeters"
msgstr "轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3410
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for perimeters. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for perimeters."
msgstr "这是打印机将用于周长的加速度。设置为零可禁用周长的加速控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3418
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for external perimeters. Set "
"zero to use the value for perimeters."
msgstr "这是您的打印机将用于外部边界的加速度。将零设置为使用边界的值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3425 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2145
msgid "Perimeter extruder"
msgstr "轮廓挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3427
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing perimeters and brim. First extruder is 1."
msgstr "打印轮廓和外围裙边时使用的挤出机。第一个挤出机为 1。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3437
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for perimeters. "
"You may want to use thinner extrudates to get more accurate surfaces. If "
"left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, otherwise 1.125 x "
"nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage (for example 200%) "
"it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, depending on the "
"'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置轮廓的挤出宽度。你可能希望使用更细的挤出以获得更精确的表"
"面。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已设置），否则使用 1.125 倍喷嘴直径。若"
"以百分比表示（例如 200%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层"
"高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3451
msgid ""
"Speed for perimeters (contours, aka vertical shells). Set to zero for auto."
msgstr "边界的速度 (等高线, 也称为垂直壳)。自动设置为零。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3461
msgid ""
"This option sets the minimum number of perimeters to generate for each "
"layer. preFlight may add extra perimeter loops in areas where the wall is "
"wider than a single perimeter loop but too narrow for infill. The Extra "
"Perimeters option can also increase this number on sloping surfaces."
msgstr ""
"此选项设置每层生成的最小轮廓数。在壁比单条轮廓宽但又太窄无法填充的区域，"
"preFlight 可能会添加额外的轮廓环。额外轮廓选项也可能在倾斜表面上增加此数量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3465
msgid "(minimum)"
msgstr "（最小）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3472 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1737
msgid "Enable Serpentine"
msgstr "启用蛇形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3474
msgid ""
"Prints a region as a continuous serpentine extrusion: a single line that "
"weaves back and forth, inward from the walls. Without a depth limit it fills "
"the whole cross-section, replacing the region's perimeters and infill; with "
"a depth limit it forms a band along the walls and the interior is filled "
"with normal infill.\n"
"\n"
"Enabling this switches the perimeter generator to Athena and takes over the "
"region's perimeters and most related wall settings.\n"
"\n"
"Best on simple, symmetric parts such as nuts, bolts, and knurled knobs; "
"complex shapes may slice poorly."
msgstr ""
"将区域打印为连续的蛇形挤出：一条从壁向内来回蜿蜒的单线。未设置深度限制时，它"
"会填满整个横截面，取代该区域的轮廓和填充；设置深度限制后，它会沿壁形成一圈带"
"状区域，内部则采用普通填充。\n"
"\n"
"启用此项会将轮廓生成器切换为 Athena，并接管该区域的轮廓及大多数相关壁设置。\n"
"\n"
"在螺母、螺栓、滚花旋钮等简单对称的零件上效果最佳；复杂形状可能切片效果不佳。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3485
msgid "Serpentine extrusion width"
msgstr "蛇形挤出宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3487
msgid ""
"Width of the serpentine extrusion. If expressed as percentage (for example "
"105%), it will be computed over layer height. Set to 0 to use the external "
"perimeter extrusion width."
msgstr ""
"蛇形挤出线的宽度。若以百分比表示(例如 105%),将按层高度计算。设为 0 则使用外轮"
"廓挤出宽度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3496
msgid "Serpentine overlap"
msgstr "蛇形重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3498
msgid ""
"How deeply neighboring serpentine beads bond into each other. Percent values "
"are computed over layer height, matching the Interlocking overlap semantics. "
"Negative values spread the beads apart instead, leaving a uniform gap "
"between them that lowers the effective density.\n"
"\n"
"Default: 10.73% (safe starting point)"
msgstr ""
"相邻蛇形挤出线相互结合的深度。百分比值按层高度计算,与互锁重叠的含义一致。负值"
"则将挤出线彼此分开,在它们之间留下均匀的间隙,从而降低有效密度。\n"
"\n"
"默认:10.73%(安全起点)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3510
msgid "Serpentine maximum bead width"
msgstr "蛇形最大线宽"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3512
msgid ""
"Upper limit for bead widening, as a percent of the nozzle diameter. Where "
"the pattern opens up at depth, beads grow up to this width to fill the gap."
msgstr ""
"挤出线加宽的上限(占喷嘴直径的百分比)。在图案于深处张开的地方,挤出线会加宽到此"
"宽度以填补空隙。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3520 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1741
msgid "Relaxed spacing"
msgstr "宽松间距"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3522
msgid ""
"Space the serpentine teeth apart instead of packing them tightly: the bead "
"follows the wall cleanly for the distance set below, then turns inward as a "
"single solid rib and returns to the wall, like spokes on a wheel. The "
"spacing acts as a fill density control while the part keeps one continuous "
"bead and a single-bead wall.\n"
"\n"
"Ribs stack vertically into continuous webs (the Ridges setting is ignored) "
"and holes print as plain single-bead loops. The interior stays mostly open, "
"so this suits open-top parts; solid top surfaces cannot bridge the cells. "
"Overrides the depth limit when both are enabled."
msgstr ""
"将蛇形齿分开而不是紧密排列：线沿壁面干净地延伸下方设定的距离，然后作为一条完"
"整的筋向内转弯并返回壁面，就像车轮上的辐条。间距起到填充密度控制的作用，同时"
"零件保持一条连续的线和单线壁。\n"
"\n"
"筋垂直堆叠成连续的腹板（脊线设置将被忽略），孔则打印为简单的单线环。内部大体"
"保持开放，因此适合顶部开放的零件；实心顶面无法桥接这些空腔。两者都启用时，将"
"覆盖深度限制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3533 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1742
msgid "Rib spacing"
msgstr "筋间距"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3535
msgid ""
"Distance the bead follows the wall between ribs when Relaxed spacing is "
"enabled. Ribs march from the seam at exactly this spacing in both "
"directions; the leftover is absorbed by one wider or narrower cell on the "
"far side, so rib columns stack into unbroken vertical webs even on tapered "
"parts. Smaller values pack more ribs (denser fill); values below about two "
"extrusion widths are floored to the classic dense pitch."
msgstr ""
"启用宽松间距时，筋之间线沿壁面延伸的距离。筋从接缝起沿两个方向精确地按此间距"
"排列；多余部分由远端一个更宽或更窄的空腔吸收，因此即使在锥形零件上，筋列也会"
"堆叠成不间断的垂直腹板。数值越小，筋越密集（填充更密）；低于约两倍挤出宽度的"
"数值将被限制为经典密集间距。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3546 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1743
msgid "Outer surface loop"
msgstr "外表面环圈"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3548
msgid ""
"Wraps one continuous perimeter around the outside of the serpentine pattern "
"and moves the tooth-carrying wall just inside it, bonded to it. The tooth "
"openings then interrupt only the hidden inner wall, so the outer surface is "
"a single uninterrupted bead: the extrusion snakes out through one widened "
"tooth, loops the whole object, and snakes back in, leaving a single seam-"
"like crossover. The pattern stacks aligned so the seam forms one vertical "
"column (the Ridges setting is ignored). Works at both classic and relaxed "
"spacing."
msgstr ""
"用一条连续轮廓包裹蛇形图案的外侧，并将承载齿的壁移到其内侧紧贴处，与之粘合。"
"齿的开口随后只中断隐藏的内壁，因此外表面是一条不间断的线：挤出通过一个加宽的"
"齿向外蜿蜒，绕行整个物体，再蜿蜒返回，只留下一处类似接缝的交叉点。图案对齐堆"
"叠，使接缝形成一条垂直列（脊线设置将被忽略）。在经典和宽松间距下均可使用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3558
msgid "Limit Serpentine depth"
msgstr "限制蛇形深度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3560
msgid ""
"Restrict the serpentine pattern to a wall of the depth set below instead of "
"filling the whole region. The interior beyond that depth is filled normally "
"(sparse infill, solid top and bottom layers), exactly like the leftover area "
"behind ordinary perimeters. When disabled, the serpentine fills the entire "
"region."
msgstr ""
"将蛇形图案限制在下方设定深度的壁内，而不是填充整个区域。超出该深度的内部以正"
"常方式填充（稀疏加密、实体顶底层），与普通轮廓后方的剩余区域处理方式完全相"
"同。禁用时，蛇形将填充整个区域。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3567
msgid "Serpentine depth"
msgstr "蛇形深度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3569
msgid ""
"Maximum depth the serpentine wall reaches inward from the surface when "
"\"Limit Serpentine depth\" is enabled. The interior beyond this depth is "
"filled normally.\n"
"\n"
"The smallest pattern that can close is two extrusion widths, so any smaller "
"value is raised to that minimum."
msgstr ""
"启用「限制蛇形深度」时蛇形壁从表面向内延伸的最大深度。超出该深度的内部以正常"
"方式填充。\n"
"\n"
"可闭合的最小图案为两个挤出宽度；任何更小的值都会被提升到该最小值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3578 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1746
msgid "Solid top/bottom surfaces"
msgstr "顶面/底面实心"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3580
msgid ""
"Print the visible portions of top and bottom surfaces as ordinary solid "
"infill, using the solid layer counts from Horizontal shells. The boundary "
"keeps the serpentine zigzag at its shortest depth so the side pattern stays "
"continuous, and covered interior areas continue as serpentine."
msgstr ""
"按水平外壳的实心层数,将顶面和底面的可见部分打印为普通实心填充。边界保留最短深"
"度的蛇形锯齿带,侧面图案因此保持连续,被遮盖的内部区域继续使用蛇形打印。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3587
msgid "Serpentine ridges"
msgstr "蛇形脊线"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3589
msgid ""
"Controls how the external zigzag ridges stack from layer to layer.\n"
"• Aligned: ridges stack vertically into straight columns.\n"
"• Staggered: the pattern staggers half a tooth each layer, so every cap is "
"bridged by the layers above and below (brickwork).\n"
"• Random: the pattern lands at a random position on every layer."
msgstr ""
"控制外部锯齿脊线在层间的堆叠方式。\n"
"• 对齐：脊线垂直堆叠成笔直的立柱。\n"
"• 交错：图案每层偏移半个齿距，使每个顶盖由上下两层架桥连接（砖砌排列）。\n"
"• 随机：图案每层落在随机位置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3595 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4076
msgid "Aligned"
msgstr "对齐"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3595
msgid "Staggered"
msgstr "交错"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3595 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4076
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ArrangeSettingsDialogImgui.cpp:103
msgid "Random"
msgstr "随机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3599
msgid "Serpentine aim"
msgstr "蛇形瞄准方向"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3601
msgid ""
"How depth-limited Serpentine teeth are aimed. Convergent points every tooth "
"at the part center, giving a smooth radial fan (best for round parts like "
"bolts and nuts). Perpendicular points each tooth square to the wall (best "
"for curved or irregular parts). Only applies when depth limit is on."
msgstr ""
"限制深度的蛇形齿的瞄准方式。收敛模式将每颗齿指向零件中心，形成平滑的放射状扇"
"形（最适合螺栓、螺母等圆形零件）。垂直模式将每颗齿垂直于壁面（最适合曲线或不"
"规则零件）。仅在启用深度限制时生效。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3606
msgid "Convergent"
msgstr "收敛"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3607
msgid "Perpendicular"
msgstr "垂直"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3611
msgid "Enable interlocking perimeters"
msgstr "启用互锁轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3613
msgid ""
"Creates interlocking layers by varying spacing of innermost perimeters "
"across layers. When combined with over-extrusion, material compresses into "
"gaps for enhanced layer bonding. Expected strength increase: 10-15% with no "
"additional material or time cost."
msgstr ""
"通过跨层改变最内层轮廓的间距来创建互锁层。与过挤出结合时，材料会压入间隙以增"
"强层间粘合。预期强度提升：10-15%，不增加额外的材料或时间成本。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3620
msgid "Interlocking perimeter count"
msgstr "互锁轮廓数量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3622
msgid ""
"Number of interlocking perimeter shells at sparse infill boundaries. These "
"shells alternate overlap patterns between layers - each layer creates gaps "
"that the next layer fills, forming mechanical interlocking."
msgstr ""
"稀疏填充边界处互锁轮廓壳的数量。这些壳在层间交替重叠图案——每层创建的间隙由下"
"一层填充，形成机械互锁。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3625 src/slic3r/GUI/PresetHints.cpp:223
msgid "perimeters"
msgstr "轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3631 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1757
msgid "Perimeters while interlocking"
msgstr "互锁时的轮廓数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3633
msgid ""
"Overrides the number of regular perimeters on layers where interlocking is "
"active. Layers near top/bottom surfaces (controlled by the solid layers "
"settings) use the normal perimeter count.\n"
"\n"
"0 = use the normal Perimeters setting (no override)\n"
">0 = use this many regular perimeters on interlocking layers\n"
"\n"
"This allows thinner walls on interior layers while retaining interlocking "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"覆盖互锁激活的层上的常规轮廓数量。靠近顶/底面的层（由实心层设置控制）使用正常"
"的轮廓数。\n"
"\n"
"0 = 使用正常的轮廓设置（不覆盖）\n"
">0 = 在互锁层上使用此数量的常规轮廓\n"
"\n"
"这允许在内部层使用更薄的壁，同时保留互锁强度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3639
msgid "(0 = off)"
msgstr "（0 = 关闭）"

#. TRN: This is a label of a column of parameters in settings to be used when the area is above certain threshold.
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3646 src/slic3r/GUI/Search.cpp:117
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:7962
msgid "Above"
msgstr "以上"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3647
msgid "Solid layers above interlocking"
msgstr "互锁上方的实心层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3649
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and a top surface. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互锁轮廓与顶面之间的实心层数。确保互锁图案完全隐藏在物体内部。"

#. TRN: This is a label of a column of parameters in settings to be used when the area is below certain threshold.
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3656 src/slic3r/GUI/Search.cpp:117
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:7960
msgid "Below"
msgstr "以下"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3657
msgid "Solid layers below interlocking"
msgstr "互锁下方的实心层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3659
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and a bottom surface. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互锁轮廓与底面之间的实心层数。确保互锁图案完全隐藏在物体内部。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3666
msgid "Interlocking strength"
msgstr "互锁强度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3668
msgid ""
"Controls interlocking extrusion amount. At 100%, inner interlocking shells "
"extrude at 200% flow to compress material into gaps from the layer below.\n"
"\n"
"100% = base interlocking (200% flow on inner shells)\n"
"150% = aggressive (may cause artifacts)\n"
"\n"
"Note: The gap between interlocking shells is controlled separately by "
"'Interlocking overlap'."
msgstr ""
"控制互锁挤出量。在 100% 时，内部互锁壳以 200% 流量挤出，将材料压入下一层的间"
"隙。\n"
"\n"
"100% = 基础互锁（内壳 200% 流量）\n"
"150% = 激进（可能产生瑕疵）\n"
"\n"
"注意：互锁壳之间的间隙由“互锁重叠”单独控制。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3680
msgid "Interlocking overlap"
msgstr "互锁重叠"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3682
msgid ""
"Controls the gap width between interlocking shells. Higher values narrow the "
"channels and compress more material into the interlocking pattern, resulting "
"in a stronger bond.\n"
"\n"
"Default: 10.73% (safe starting point)\n"
"\n"
"Start with a test print at 10.73% and increase gradually until over-"
"extrusion is reached, then dial it back to the last safe value."
msgstr ""
"控制互锁壳之间的间隙宽度。值越高，通道越窄，压入互锁图案的材料越多，从而获得"
"更强的粘合。\n"
"\n"
"默认：10.73%（安全起点）\n"
"\n"
"先以 10.73% 进行测试打印，逐步增加直到出现过挤出，然后回调到最后一个安全值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3696 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2146
msgid "Interlocking perimeter extruder"
msgstr "互锁轮廓挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3698
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing interlocking perimeters. First extruder is "
"1."
msgstr "打印互锁轮廓时使用的挤出机。第一个挤出机为 1。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3704
msgid "Interlocking flow detection"
msgstr "互锁流量检测"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3706
msgid ""
"Controls how precisely interlocking flow boundaries are detected. When "
"interlocking perimeters cross from over-interlocking to non-interlocking "
"regions, the flow rate must change. This setting determines how frequently "
"boundaries are checked.\n"
"\n"
"• Precise (1mm): Highest accuracy, checks every 1mm. Best quality at "
"boundaries.\n"
"• Standard (2mm): Good balance of accuracy and speed.\n"
"• Relaxed (4mm): Faster slicing, minor boundary imprecision.\n"
"• Minimal (8mm): Fastest slicing, noticeable imprecision at boundaries.\n"
"\n"
"Lower values increase slicing time but improve flow accuracy at zone "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""
"控制互锁流量边界的检测精度。当互锁轮廓从过互锁区域穿越到非互锁区域时，流量必"
"须改变。此设置决定检查边界的频率。\n"
"\n"
"• 精确（1mm）：精度最高，每 1mm 检查一次。边界处质量最佳。\n"
"• 标准（2mm）：精度与速度的良好平衡。\n"
"• 宽松（4mm）：切片更快，边界略有不精确。\n"
"• 最低（8mm）：切片最快，边界处有明显不精确。\n"
"\n"
"值越低，切片时间越长，但区域边界处的流量精度越高。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3721
msgid "Post-processing scripts"
msgstr "后处理脚本"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3722
msgid ""
"If you want to process the output G-code through custom scripts, just list "
"their absolute paths here. Separate multiple scripts with a semicolon. "
"Scripts will be passed the absolute path to the G-code file as the first "
"argument, and they can access the Slic3r config settings by reading "
"environment variables."
msgstr ""
"如果要通过自定义脚本处理输出 G-Code , 只需在此处列出它们的绝对路径即可。用分"
"号分隔多个脚本。脚本将作为第一个参数传递到 G-Code 文件的绝对路径, 并且它们可"
"以通过读取环境变量访问 Slic3r 配置设置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3734
msgid "Enable export script"
msgstr "启用导出脚本"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3735 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3744
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1637 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2470
msgid "Output options"
msgstr "输出选项"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3736
msgid ""
"When enabled, an 'Export to Script' option appears in the export menu. The "
"configured Python script receives the G-code data and handles output - "
"saving to disk, uploading via FTP, or both."
msgstr ""
"启用后，导出菜单中会出现“导出到脚本”选项。配置的 Python 脚本接收 G-code 数据"
"并处理输出——保存到磁盘、通过 FTP 上传，或两者皆可。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3743
msgid "Export script"
msgstr "导出脚本"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3745
msgid ""
"Path to a Python script that handles G-code export. The script must define "
"an export(gcode) function that receives a gcode object with .data (list of G-"
"code lines) and .filename (suggested output name)."
msgstr ""
"处理 G-code 导出的 Python 脚本路径。该脚本必须定义一个 export(gcode) 函数，接"
"收带有 .data（G-code 行列表）和 .filename（建议的输出名称）的 gcode 对象。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3752 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3759
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3766
msgid "Enable preprocessing"
msgstr "启用预处理"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3753 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3760
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3767 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3774
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3780 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3786
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1071 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2459
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:3467 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:4266
msgid "Preprocessing"
msgstr "预处理"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3754
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this filament profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"为此耗材配置启用 Python 预处理脚本。脚本在切片期间运行，可读取/修改 G-code 移"
"动。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3761
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this print profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"为此打印配置启用 Python 预处理脚本。脚本在切片期间运行，可读取/修改 G-code 移"
"动。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3768
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this printer profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"为此打印机配置启用 Python 预处理脚本。脚本在切片期间运行，可读取/修改 G-code "
"移动。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3773 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3779
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3785
msgid "Preprocessing scripts"
msgstr "预处理脚本"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3775
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this filament profile."
msgstr "此耗材配置的 Python 预处理脚本路径有序列表。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3781
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this print profile."
msgstr "此打印配置的 Python 预处理脚本路径有序列表。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3787
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this printer profile."
msgstr "此打印机配置的 Python 预处理脚本路径有序列表。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3791
msgid "Printer type"
msgstr "打印机类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3792
msgid "Type of the printer."
msgstr "打印机的类型。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3797
msgid "Printer notes"
msgstr "打印机备注"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3798
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the printer here."
msgstr "您可以在此处放置有关打印机的备注。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3806
msgid "Printer vendor"
msgstr "打印机供应商"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3807
msgid "Name of the printer vendor."
msgstr "打印机供应商的名称。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3812
msgid "Printer variant"
msgstr "打印机版本"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3814
msgid ""
"Name of the printer variant. For example, the printer variants may be "
"differentiated by a nozzle diameter."
msgstr "打印机变体的版本。例如, 打印机版本可以通过喷嘴直径进行区分。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3831 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1966
msgid "Raft contact Z distance"
msgstr "筏板接触Z距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3833
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between object and raft. Ignored for soluble interface."
msgstr "物体与木筏之间的垂直距离。对于可溶解的界面忽略。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3840 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1967
msgid "Raft expansion"
msgstr "筏式膨胀"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3842
msgid "Expansion of the raft in XY plane for better stability."
msgstr "在 XY 平面上扩展筏板，以获得更好的稳定性。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3849
msgid "First layer density"
msgstr "第一层密度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3851
msgid "Density of the first raft or support layer."
msgstr "第一个筏板或支撑层的密度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3859
msgid "First layer expansion"
msgstr "第一层扩展"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3861
msgid ""
"Expansion of the first raft or support layer to improve adhesion to print "
"bed."
msgstr "扩展第一层筏板或支撑层，以提高与印刷床的附着力。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3868 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1965
msgid "Raft layers"
msgstr "筏层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3870
msgid ""
"The object will be raised by this number of layers, and support material "
"will be generated under it."
msgstr "对象将相对此层数抬高，并在其下生成支撑材料。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3878
msgid "Slice resolution"
msgstr "切片分辨率"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3879
msgid ""
"Minimum detail resolution, used to simplify the input file for speeding up "
"the slicing job and reducing memory usage. High-resolution models often "
"carry more detail than printers can render. Set to zero to disable any "
"simplification and use full resolution from input."
msgstr ""
"最小细节分辨率，用于简化输入文件以加快切片作业和减少内存使用量。高分辨率模型"
"通常携带比打印机渲染更多的细节。设置为零以禁用任何简化并使用输入的全分辨率。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3889 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2305
msgid "G-code resolution"
msgstr "G-Code 解析"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3891
msgid ""
"Maximum deviation of exported G-code paths from their full resolution "
"counterparts. Very high resolution G-code requires huge amount of RAM to "
"slice and preview, also a 3D printer may stutter not being able to process a "
"high resolution G-code in a timely manner. On the other hand, a low "
"resolution G-code will produce a low poly effect and because the G-code "
"reduction is performed at each layer independently, visible artifacts may be "
"produced."
msgstr ""
"导出 G-Code 路径与其全分辨率对应路径的最大偏差。非常高分辨率的 G-Code 需要大"
"量的 RAM 才能进行切片和预览，而且 3D 打印机可能会因无法及时处理高分辨率的 G-"
"Code 而结巴。另一方面，低分辨率 G-Code 将产生低多边形效果，并且由于 G-Code 缩"
"减在每一层独立地执行，因此可能会产生可见的伪影。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3902
msgid "Minimum travel after retraction"
msgstr "回抽最小行程"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3903
msgid ""
"Retraction is not triggered when travel moves are shorter than this length."
msgstr "当打印移动短于此长度时，不会触发回抽。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3909
msgid "Retract amount before wipe"
msgstr "擦拭前的回抽量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3910
msgid ""
"With bowden extruders, it may be wise to do some amount of quick retract "
"before doing the wipe movement."
msgstr "对于远程挤出机, 在做擦拭动作之前, 做一些快速的收回可能是明智的。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3917
msgid "Extend wipe"
msgstr "延长擦拭"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3918
msgid ""
"When enabled, the wipe move continues in the same direction as the last "
"extrusion move. When disabled (default), the wipe follows the perimeter loop "
"for the duration of the move."
msgstr ""
"启用后，擦拭移动会沿最后一次挤出移动的相同方向继续。禁用时（默认），擦拭在移"
"动期间沿轮廓环进行。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3924 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5594
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:7096
msgid "Wipe length"
msgstr "擦拭长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3925
msgid ""
"Length of the wipe move. When using firmware retraction or without 'Wipe "
"while retracting', the wipe will be a pure travel move (no retraction). Set "
"to 0 to use the default wipe behavior based on retraction length."
msgstr ""
"擦拭移动的长度。使用固件回抽或未启用“回抽时擦拭”时，擦拭将是纯行程移动（无回"
"抽）。设为 0 则使用基于回抽长度的默认擦拭行为。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3934 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5590
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:7092
msgid "Retract on layer change"
msgstr "在图层更改时回抽"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3935
msgid "This flag enforces a retraction whenever a Z move is done."
msgstr "每当完成 Z 移动时，都会强制回抽。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3940 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5582
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5601 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:7086
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:7104
msgid "Retraction length"
msgstr "回抽长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3941
msgid "Retraction Length"
msgstr "回抽长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3942
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered, filament is pulled back by the specified "
"amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it enters the "
"extruder)."
msgstr "触发回抽时，耗材按指定量拉回（长度在进入挤出机之前在原始耗材上测量）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3948
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoMeasure.cpp:2520
msgid "Length"
msgstr "长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3949
msgid "Retraction Length (Toolchange)"
msgstr "回抽长度 (工具更换)"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3950
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered before changing tool, filament is pulled back "
"by the specified amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it "
"enters the extruder)."
msgstr ""
"在更换热头之前触发回抽时，耗材按指定量拉回（长度在进入挤出机之前在原始耗材上"
"测量）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3958
msgid "Ramping slope angle"
msgstr "斜坡角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3959
msgid "Slope of the ramp in the initial phase of the travel."
msgstr "行程初始阶段斜坡的坡度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3967
msgid "Use ramping lift"
msgstr "使用斜坡抬升"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3968
msgid ""
"Generates a ramping lift instead of lifting the extruder directly upwards. "
"The travel is split into two phases: the ramp and the standard horizontal "
"travel. This option helps reduce stringing."
msgstr ""
"生成斜坡抬升，而非将挤出机直接向上抬升。行程分为两个阶段：斜坡和标准水平行"
"程。此选项有助于减少拉丝。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3975
msgid "Maximum ramping lift"
msgstr "最大斜坡抬升"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3976
msgid ""
"Maximum lift height of the ramping lift. It may not be reached if the next "
"position is close to the old one."
msgstr "斜坡抬升的最大抬升高度。如果下一位置离原位置很近，可能达不到此高度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3985
msgid "Steeper ramp before obstacles"
msgstr "障碍前更陡的斜坡"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3986
msgid ""
"If enabled, preFlight detects obstacles along the travel path and makes the "
"slope steeper in case an obstacle might be hit during the initial phase of "
"the travel."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，preFlight 会检测行程路径上的障碍，并在行程初始阶段可能撞到障碍时使"
"坡度更陡。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3994
msgid ""
"High flow nozzles allow higher print speeds.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This value is controlled from Print Settings > Advanced > Tool "
"Configuration"
msgstr ""
"高流量喷嘴允许更高的打印速度。\n"
"\n"
"注意：此值在“打印设置 > 高级 > 工具配置”中控制"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4000
msgid "Lift height"
msgstr "抬升高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4001
msgid "Lift height applied before travel."
msgstr "行程前应用的抬升高度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4009
msgid "Above Z"
msgstr "Z 高于"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4010
msgid "Only lift Z above"
msgstr "仅提升 Z 高于"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4011
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place above the "
"specified absolute Z. You can tune this setting for skipping lift on the "
"first layers."
msgstr ""
"如果将此值设置为正值，则 Z 提升将仅发生在指定的绝对 Z 上方。您可以调整此设置"
"以跳过第一个图层上的提升。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4018
msgid "Below Z"
msgstr "Z 低于"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4019
msgid "Only lift Z below"
msgstr "仅提升 Z 低于"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4020
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place below the "
"specified absolute Z. You can tune this setting for limiting lift to the "
"first layers."
msgstr ""
"如果将此值设置为正值，则 Z 提升将仅发生在指定的绝对 Z 以下。您可以调整此设"
"置，将提升限制为第一个图层。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4028
msgid "Deretraction extra length"
msgstr "回抽恢复额外长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4029
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after the travel move, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament. This setting is rarely needed."
msgstr ""
"当回抽在打印后得到补偿时，挤出机将推进这个额外的耗材量。很少需要此设置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4036
msgid "Extra length on restart"
msgstr "重新启动时的额外长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4037
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after changing tool, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament."
msgstr "当更换热头后补偿回抽时，挤出机将推进这额外的耗材量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4044 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4045
msgid "Retraction Speed"
msgstr "回抽速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4046
msgid "The speed for retractions (it only applies to the extruder motor)."
msgstr "回抽速度 (仅适用于挤出机电机)。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4052 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4053
msgid "Deretraction Speed"
msgstr "减速速度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4054
msgid ""
"The speed for loading of a filament into extruder after retraction (it only "
"applies to the extruder motor). If left to zero, the retraction speed is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"收回后将耗材装入挤出机的速度 (仅适用于挤出机电机)。如果保持为零, 则使用回抽速"
"度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4061 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:7113
msgid "Seam gap distance"
msgstr "接缝间隙距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4062
msgid ""
"The distance between the endpoints of a closed loop perimeter. Positive "
"values will shorten and interrupt the loop slightly to reduce the seam. "
"Negative values will extend the loop, causing the endpoints to overlap "
"slightly. When percents are used, the distance is derived from the nozzle "
"diameter. Set to zero to disable this feature."
msgstr ""
"闭合环路轮廓两端点之间的距离。正值会稍微缩短并中断环路以减少接缝。负值会延长"
"环路，使两端点稍微重叠。使用百分比时，距离根据喷嘴直径推导。设为零可禁用此功"
"能。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4072 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1784
msgid "Seam position"
msgstr "接缝位置"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4074
msgid "Position of perimeters starting points."
msgstr "轮廓起点的位置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4076
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "最近的"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4076 src/slic3r/GUI/MainFrame.cpp:1999
msgid "Rear"
msgstr "后面"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4081 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1789
msgid "Staggered inner seams"
msgstr "交错内接缝"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4084
msgid ""
"This option causes the inner seams to be shifted backwards based on their "
"depth, forming a zigzag pattern."
msgstr "此选项会导致内部接缝根据其深度向后移动，从而形成Z字形图案。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4089 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1785
msgid "Seam type"
msgstr "接缝类型"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4091
msgid ""
"Controls how the seam point on external perimeters is shaped to hide start/"
"stop blobs.\n"
"\n"
"Regular - No seam shaping. Standard seam behavior.\n"
"\n"
"Nip/Tuck - Creates a V-shaped channel one perimeter deep at the seam. Both "
"the start and end of the external perimeter are pushed inward, and the first "
"inner perimeter is trimmed to absorb the disturbance.\n"
"\n"
"Nip - Only the start of the external perimeter is pushed inward at the seam. "
"The end remains on the normal path. The inner perimeter is trimmed on the "
"start side only.\n"
"\n"
"Tuck - Only the end of the external perimeter is pushed inward at the seam. "
"The start remains on the normal path. The inner perimeter is trimmed on the "
"end side only.\n"
"\n"
"Alt. Nip/Tuck - Alternates between Nip on even layers and Tuck on odd "
"layers. This distributes the seam disturbance across both sides of the "
"junction, preventing a consistent bulge on one side.\n"
"\n"
"Note: All non-Regular modes require multiple perimeters and are not used in "
"Spiral Vase mode."
msgstr ""
"控制外轮廓上接缝点的成形方式，以隐藏起止处的瑕疵。\n"
"\n"
"常规 - 不进行接缝成形。标准接缝行为。\n"
"\n"
"Nip/Tuck - 在接缝处创建一条一条轮廓深的 V 形通道。外轮廓的起点和终点都向内"
"推，第一条内轮廓被修剪以吸收扰动。\n"
"\n"
"Nip - 接缝处只有外轮廓的起点向内推。终点保持在正常路径上。仅在起点侧修剪内轮"
"廓。\n"
"\n"
"Tuck - 接缝处只有外轮廓的终点向内推。起点保持在正常路径上。仅在终点侧修剪内轮"
"廓。\n"
"\n"
"Alt. Nip/Tuck - 在偶数层使用 Nip、奇数层使用 Tuck 之间交替。这将接缝扰动分布"
"到接合处的两侧，防止一侧出现持续的凸起。\n"
"\n"
"注意：所有非常规模式都需要多条轮廓，且不用于螺旋花瓶模式。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4107 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4512
msgid "Regular"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4108
msgid "Nip/Tuck"
msgstr "Nip/Tuck"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4109
msgid "Nip"
msgstr "Nip"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4110
msgid "Tuck"
msgstr "Tuck"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4111
msgid "Alt. Nip/Tuck"
msgstr "Alt. Nip/Tuck"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4114 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1786
msgid "Seam notch width"
msgstr "接缝凹槽宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4116
msgid ""
"Width of the V-shaped notch as a multiple of the external perimeter "
"extrusion width. In Nip/Tuck mode, this is the full notch width across both "
"sides of the seam. In Nip or Tuck mode, only half the width is used since "
"only one side of the seam is shaped. The depth is automatically calculated "
"from perimeter spacing. Wider values are more forgiving for blobs but create "
"a larger surface depression. Narrower values are subtler."
msgstr ""
"V 形凹槽的宽度，以外轮廓挤出宽度的倍数表示。在 Nip/Tuck 模式下，这是接缝两侧"
"的完整凹槽宽度。在 Nip 或 Tuck 模式下，由于只成形接缝的一侧，只使用一半宽度。"
"深度根据轮廓间距自动计算。较宽的值对瑕疵更宽容，但会造成更大的表面凹陷。较窄"
"的值更不易察觉。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4122
msgid "x ext. width"
msgstr "x 外轮廓宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4129 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1787
msgid "Seam notch corner threshold"
msgstr "接缝凹槽角度阈值"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4132
msgid ""
"Controls where seam notching is applied based on corner sharpness. At sharp "
"corners the seam is naturally hidden by the geometry, so notching is "
"unnecessary.\n"
"\n"
"Seams on corners sharper than this angle are skipped. The default of 44° "
"means any corner of 44° or less is considered sharp enough to hide the seam "
"on its own - just under 45°, where a clean fold already conceals the "
"junction.\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to apply seam notching everywhere regardless of corner angle."
msgstr ""
"根据拐角锐度控制接缝凹槽的应用位置。在尖锐拐角处，接缝自然被几何形状隐藏，因"
"此无需凹槽。\n"
"\n"
"比此角度更锐的拐角上的接缝会被跳过。默认 44° 表示任何 44° 或更小的拐角都被视"
"为足够尖锐，可自行隐藏接缝——略低于 45°，干净的折叠已能掩盖接合处。\n"
"\n"
"设为 0 则无论拐角角度如何都应用接缝凹槽。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4146
msgid "Scarf joint placement"
msgstr "斜接接缝位置"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4148
msgid "Where to place scarf joint seam."
msgstr "斜接接缝放置的位置。"

#. TRN: Drop-down option for 'Scarf joint placement' parameter.
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4153
msgid "Nowhere"
msgstr "无处"

#. TRN: Drop-down option for 'Scarf joint placement' parameter.
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4155
msgid "Contours"
msgstr "轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4156
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:133
msgid "Everywhere"
msgstr "任何地方"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4159
msgid "Scarf joint only on smooth perimeters"
msgstr "仅在平滑轮廓上斜接"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4161
msgid "Only use the scarf joint when the perimeter is smooth."
msgstr "仅当轮廓平滑时使用斜接接缝。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4166 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1793
msgid "Scarf start height"
msgstr "斜接起始高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4168
msgid ""
"Start height of the scarf joint specified as fraction of the current layer "
"height."
msgstr "斜接接缝的起始高度，以当前层高的分数表示。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4176
msgid "Scarf joint around entire perimeter"
msgstr "斜接环绕整条轮廓"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4178
msgid "Extend the scarf around entire length of the perimeter."
msgstr "将斜接延伸到整条轮廓的长度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4183
msgid "Scarf joint length"
msgstr "斜接长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4185
msgid "Length of the scarf joint."
msgstr "斜接接缝的长度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4192
msgid "Max scarf joint segment length"
msgstr "最大斜接段长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4194
msgid "Maximum length of any scarf joint segment."
msgstr "任何斜接接缝段的最大长度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4201
msgid "Scarf joint on inner perimeters"
msgstr "内轮廓斜接"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4203
msgid "Use scarf joint on inner perimeters."
msgstr "在内轮廓上使用斜接接缝。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4210
msgid "Direction"
msgstr "方向"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4212
msgid "Preferred direction of the seam"
msgstr "接缝的首选方向"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4213
msgid "Seam preferred direction"
msgstr "接缝首选方向"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4220
msgid "Jitter"
msgstr "抖动"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4222
msgid "Seam preferred direction jitter"
msgstr "接缝首选方向抖动"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4223
msgid "Preferred direction of the seam - jitter"
msgstr "接缝的首选方向 - 抖动"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4230
msgid "Distance from brim/object"
msgstr "与裙边/物体的距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4231
msgid ""
"Distance between skirt and brim (when draft shield is not used) or objects."
msgstr "环绕和裙边之间的距离（不使用导流板时）或物体。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4237 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1919
msgid "Skirt height"
msgstr "环绕高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4238
msgid "Height of skirt expressed in layers."
msgstr "环绕的高度以层表示。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4244 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1920
msgid "Draft shield"
msgstr "风挡"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4246
msgid ""
"With draft shield active, the skirt will be printed skirt_distance from the "
"object, possibly intersecting brim.\n"
"Enabled = skirt is as tall as the highest printed object.\n"
"Limited = skirt is as tall as specified by skirt_height.\n"
"This is useful to protect an ABS or ASA print from warping and detaching "
"from print bed due to wind draft."
msgstr ""
"在拔模护罩处于活动状态时，裙子将在距离物体一定距离（可能与边缘相交）处打"
"印。\n"
"Enabled=裙子与最高的印刷品一样高。\n"
"Limited=裙摆的高度与裙摆高度相同。\n"
"这有助于保护 ABS 或 ASA 印刷品不因风的牵伸而翘曲或从打印床上脱落。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4251
msgid "Limited"
msgstr "限制"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4256 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1917
msgid "Loops (minimum)"
msgstr "圈数（最小值）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4257
msgid "Skirt Loops"
msgstr "裙边圈数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4258
msgid ""
"Number of loops for the skirt. If the Minimum Extrusion Length option is "
"set, the number of loops might be greater than the one configured here. Set "
"this to zero to disable skirt completely."
msgstr ""
"裙边的循环数。如果设置了\"最小挤出长度\"选项，则循环数可能大于此处配置的循环"
"数。设置为零以完全禁用裙边。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4266
msgid "Slow down if layer print time is below"
msgstr "如果图层打印时间低于"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4267
msgid ""
"If layer print time is estimated below this number of seconds, print moves "
"speed will be scaled down to extend duration to this value."
msgstr ""
"如果图层打印时间估计低于此秒数，则打印移动速度将缩小以将持续时间扩展到此值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4276 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:6933
msgid "Don't slow down outer walls"
msgstr "不减慢外壁"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4277
msgid ""
"If enabled, outer wall speed will not be reduced to meet the minimum layer "
"time. This prevents wall thickness variation on thin-walled parts where the "
"cooling slowdown would otherwise cause over-extrusion at reduced speeds."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，外壁速度不会为达到最小层时间而降低。这可防止薄壁零件上的壁厚变化，"
"否则冷却减速会在降低速度时导致过挤出。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4284 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2060
msgid "Small perimeters"
msgstr "小边界"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4286
msgid ""
"Speed for perimeters having radius <= 6.5mm (usually holes). A percentage is "
"recommended - it will be calculated as a percentage of the perimeter speed, "
"whether set manually or calculated by auto speed. Set to zero to use the "
"full perimeter speed."
msgstr ""
"半径 <= 6.5mm 的轮廓（通常是孔）的速度。建议使用百分比——它将按轮廓速度的百分"
"比计算，无论轮廓速度是手动设置还是由自动速度计算。设为零则使用完整的轮廓速"
"度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4297 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1892
msgid "Solid infill threshold area"
msgstr "实心填充阈值区域"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4299
msgid ""
"Force solid infill for regions having a smaller area than the specified "
"threshold."
msgstr "对面积小于指定阈值的区域强制实心填充。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4300 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4752
msgid "mm²"
msgstr "mm²"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4306 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2148
msgid "Solid infill extruder"
msgstr "实心填充挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4308
msgid "The extruder to use when printing solid infill."
msgstr "打印实体填充时使用的挤出机。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4314 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5410
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1890
msgid "Solid infill every"
msgstr "固体填充每个"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4316 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5412
msgid ""
"This feature allows to force a solid layer every given number of layers. "
"Zero to disable. You can set this to any value (for example 9999); Slic3r "
"will automatically choose the maximum possible number of layers to combine "
"according to nozzle diameter and layer height."
msgstr ""
"此功能允许强制每个给定数量的图层的实心图层。要禁用的零。您可以将其设置为任何"
"值（例如 9999）;Slic3r 将根据喷嘴直径和层高度自动选择要合并的最大层数。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4329
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for infill for "
"solid surfaces. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, "
"depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置实心表面填充的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度"
"（若已设置），否则使用 1.125 倍喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据"
"“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4341
msgid ""
"Speed for printing solid regions (top/bottom/internal horizontal shells). "
"This can be expressed as a percentage (for example: 80%) over the default "
"infill speed above. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr ""
"打印实体区域的速度（顶部/底部/内部水平壳体）。这可以表示为百分比（例如：80%）"
"超过上述默认填充速度。为自动设置为零。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4352 src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1923
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1978
msgid "Solid layers"
msgstr "实心层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4353
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on top and bottom surfaces."
msgstr "要在顶部和底部曲面上生成的实心图层数。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4359 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4360
msgid "Minimum thickness of a top / bottom shell"
msgstr "顶部/底部外壳的最小厚度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4366 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1720
msgid "Spiral vase"
msgstr "螺旋花瓶"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4367
msgid ""
"This feature will raise Z gradually while printing a single-walled object in "
"order to remove any visible seam. This option requires a single perimeter, "
"no infill, no top solid layers and no support material. You can still set "
"any number of bottom solid layers as well as skirt/brim loops. It won't work "
"when printing more than one single object."
msgstr ""
"打印单壁对象时，此功能将逐渐升高Z，以移除任何可见接缝。此选项需要单个周长、无"
"填充、无顶部实体层和无支撑材料。您仍然可以设置任意数量的底部实体层以及裙子/帽"
"檐环。当打印多个对象时，它将不起作用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4375 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2161
msgid "Temperature variation"
msgstr "温度变化"

#. TRN PrintSettings : "Ooze prevention" > "Temperature variation"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4377
msgid ""
"Temperature difference to be applied when an extruder is not active. The "
"value is not used when 'idle_temperature' in filament settings is defined."
msgstr ""
"挤出机不活动时要应用的温度。当定义耗材设置中的 \"idle_temperature \"时，该值"
"不使用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4387
msgid "Emit temperature commands automatically"
msgstr "自动发出温度命令"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4388
msgid ""
"When enabled, preFlight will check whether your custom Start G-Code contains "
"G-codes to set extruder, bed or chamber temperature (M104, M109, M140, M190, "
"M141 and M191). If so, the temperatures will not be emitted automatically so "
"you're free to customize the order of heating commands and other custom "
"actions. Note that you can use placeholder variables for all preFlight "
"settings, so you can put a \"M109 S[first_layer_temperature]\" command "
"wherever you want.\n"
"If your custom Start G-Code does NOT contain these G-codes, preFlight will "
"execute the Start G-Code after heated chamber was set to its temperature, "
"bed reached its target temperature and extruder just started heating.\n"
"\n"
"When disabled, preFlight will NOT emit commands to heat up extruder, bed or "
"chamber, leaving all to Custom Start G-Code."
msgstr ""
"启用后，preFlight 会检查你的自定义起始 G-Code 是否包含设置挤出机、热床或腔体"
"温度的 G-code（M104、M109、M140、M190、M141 和 M191）。如果包含，则不会自动发"
"出这些温度，你可以自由定制加热指令的顺序及其他自定义操作。请注意，你可以为所"
"有 preFlight 设置使用占位符变量，因此可以把“M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]”指令放在任何位置。\n"
"如果你的自定义起始 G-Code 不包含这些 G-code，preFlight 将在加热腔体设定到其温"
"度、热床达到目标温度且挤出机刚开始加热之后执行起始 G-Code。\n"
"\n"
"禁用时，preFlight 不会发出加热挤出机、热床或腔体的指令，全部交由自定义起始 G-"
"Code 处理。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4403
msgid "Custom printer parameters"
msgstr "自定义打印机参数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4413
msgid ""
"This start procedure is inserted at the beginning, possibly prepended by "
"temperature-changing commands. See 'autoemit_temperature_commands'."
msgstr ""
"该启动程序在开始时插入，可能是前置温度变化命令准备的。请参"
"阅“autoemit_temperature_commands”。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4422
msgid "Custom filament parameters"
msgstr "自定义耗材参数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4432
msgid ""
"This start procedure is inserted at the beginning, after any printer start "
"gcode (and after any toolchange to this filament in case of multi-material "
"printers). This is used to override settings for a specific filament. If "
"preFlight detects M104, M109, M140 or M190 in your custom codes, such "
"commands will not be prepended automatically so you're free to customize the "
"order of heating commands and other custom actions. Note that you can use "
"placeholder variables for all preFlight settings, so you can put a \"M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]\" command wherever you want. If you have multiple "
"extruders, the gcode is processed in extruder order."
msgstr ""
"此启动过程在开始、任何打印机启动 gcode 后（以及多材料打印机的情况下的任何工具"
"更换到此耗材之后）插入。这用于覆盖特定耗材的设置。如果 preFlight 在自定义代码"
"中检测到 M104、M109、M140 或 M190，则此类命令不会自动预置，因此您可以自由自定"
"义加热命令和其他自定义操作的顺序。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 "
"preFlight 设置，因此您可以将\"S[first_layer_temperature]\"命令放在任何所需的"
"位置。如果您有多个挤出机，则按挤出机顺序处理 gcode。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4448
msgid "Color change G-code"
msgstr "颜色更改 G-Code"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4449
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the color change"
msgstr "此 G-Code 将用作颜色更改的代码"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4458
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the pause print"
msgstr "此 G-Code 将用作暂停打印的代码"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4467
msgid "This G-code will be used as a custom code"
msgstr "此 G-Code 将用作自定义代码"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4475
msgid "Single Extruder Multi Material"
msgstr "单挤出机多材料"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4476
msgid "The printer multiplexes filaments into a single hot end."
msgstr "打印机将耗材多路复用到一个热端。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4481
msgid "Prime all printing extruders"
msgstr "装填所有印刷挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4483
msgid ""
"If enabled, all printing extruders will be primed at the front edge of the "
"print bed at the start of the print."
msgstr "如果启用, 所有打印挤出机都将在打印开始时在构建板的前缘进行装填。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4488
msgid "No sparse layers (EXPERIMENTAL)"
msgstr "无稀疏层（实验）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4489
msgid ""
"If enabled, the wipe tower will not be printed on layers with no "
"toolchanges. On layers with a toolchange, extruder will travel downward to "
"print the wipe tower. User is responsible for ensuring there is no collision "
"with the print."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，擦拭塔将不会打印在没有工具更改的图层上。在更换工具的图层上，挤出机"
"将向下移动以打印擦拭塔。用户有责任确保不与打印冲突。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4496
msgid "Slice gap closing radius"
msgstr "切片间隙闭合半径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4499
msgid ""
"Cracks smaller than 2x gap closing radius are being filled during the "
"triangle mesh slicing. The gap closing operation may reduce the final print "
"resolution, therefore it is advisable to keep the value reasonably low."
msgstr ""
"在三角形网格切片过程中，小于 2 倍间隙闭合半径的裂纹将被填充。间隙闭合操作可能"
"会降低最终打印分辨率，因此建议将值保持在合理的较低水平。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4507
msgid "Slicing Mode"
msgstr "切片模式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4510
msgid ""
"Use \"Even-odd\" for 3DLabPrint airplane models. Use \"Close holes\" to "
"close all holes in the model."
msgstr "3DLabPrint 飞机模型使用“奇偶”。使用“关闭孔”关闭模型中的所有孔。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4512
msgid "Even-odd"
msgstr "奇偶"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4512
msgid "Close holes"
msgstr "闭合孔"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4517 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1952
msgid "Generate support material"
msgstr "生成支撑材料"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4519
msgid "Enable support material generation."
msgstr "启用支撑材料生成。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4523 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1953
msgid "Auto generated supports"
msgstr "自动生成支撑"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4525
msgid ""
"If checked, supports will be generated automatically based on the overhang "
"threshold value. If unchecked, supports will be generated inside the "
"\"Support Enforcer\" volumes only."
msgstr ""
"如果选中, 将根据悬垂阈值自动生成支撑。如果未选中, 则仅在 \"支撑执行器\" 空间"
"内生成支撑。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4531
msgid "XY separation between an object and its support"
msgstr "对象与其支撑之间的 XY 分离距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4533
msgid ""
"XY separation between an object and its support. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 50%), it will be calculated over external perimeter width."
msgstr ""
"对象与其支撑之间的 XY 分离距离。如果表示为百分比 (例如 50%), 则将根据外部外围"
"宽度计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4544 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1988
msgid "Pattern angle"
msgstr "模式角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4546
msgid ""
"Use this setting to rotate the support material pattern on the horizontal "
"plane."
msgstr "使用此设置可旋转水平平面上的支撑材料模式。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4554 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5754
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:132
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1998
msgid "Support on build plate only"
msgstr "仅从打印面板支撑"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4556
msgid ""
"Only create auto-detected support if it lies on a build plate. Don't create "
"support on a print. This setting only applies when auto-generated supports "
"are enabled; painted supports are always placed exactly where painted."
msgstr ""
"仅当自动检测的支撑落在打印板上时才创建。不在打印件上创建支撑。此设置仅在启用"
"自动生成支撑时适用；绘制的支撑始终精确放置在绘制处。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4563
msgid "Top contact Z distance"
msgstr "顶部接触 Z 距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4565
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between object and support material interface. Setting "
"this to No gap will also prevent preFlight from using bridge flow and speed "
"for the first object layer.\n"
"\n"
"Without interface layers, only No gap or Full layer height are effective. "
"Half layer and Custom values require interface layers for precise gap "
"control."
msgstr ""
"物体与支撑材料接触面之间的垂直距离。将其设为“无间隙”还会阻止 preFlight 在物体"
"首层使用桥接流量和速度。\n"
"\n"
"没有接触层时，只有“无间隙”或“整层高”有效。半层和自定义值需要接触层才能精确控"
"制间隙。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4571 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4612
msgid "No gap"
msgstr "无间隙"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4572 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4612
msgid "Half layer height"
msgstr "半层高"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4573 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4612
msgid "Full layer height"
msgstr "整层高"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4579
msgid "Custom top contact gap"
msgstr "自定义顶部接触间隙"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4581
msgid ""
"Custom vertical distance between object and support material interface. Only "
"used when Top contact Z distance is set to Custom. The gap is achieved by "
"adjusting interface layer heights. With very few interface layers (0-1), the "
"exact gap may be approximated."
msgstr ""
"物体与支撑材料接触面之间的自定义垂直距离。仅当顶部接触 Z 距离设为“自定义”时使"
"用。该间隙通过调整接触层高度实现。当接触层很少（0-1）时，可能近似达到所需间"
"隙。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4592 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1978
msgid "Top contact extrusion width"
msgstr "顶部接触挤出宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4594
msgid ""
"Width of extrusions for the top support interface layer, as a percentage of "
"the interface width. Lower values create thinner extrusions for easier "
"separation from the supported surface. 100% uses the full interface width.\n"
"\n"
"The actual width will never go below the layer height to prevent extrusion "
"errors.\n"
"\n"
"Without interface layers, this setting only applies when Top contact Z "
"distance is set to 0 (no gap)."
msgstr ""
"顶部支撑接触层挤出的宽度，以接触面宽度的百分比表示。值越低，挤出越细，越易于"
"与被支撑表面分离。100% 使用完整接触面宽度。\n"
"\n"
"实际宽度永远不会低于层高，以防止挤出错误。\n"
"\n"
"没有接触层时，此设置仅在顶部接触 Z 距离设为 0（无间隙）时适用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4607 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1980
msgid "Bottom contact Z distance"
msgstr "底部接触 Z 距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4609
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between the object top surface and the support "
"material interface. Options are relative to layer height to ensure proper "
"alignment when supports merge."
msgstr ""
"物体顶面与支撑材料接触面之间的垂直距离。各选项相对于层高，以确保支撑合并时正"
"确对齐。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4617 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1982
msgid "Bottom contact extrusion width"
msgstr "底部接触挤出宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4619
msgid ""
"Width of extrusions for the bottom contact layer when using half-layer gap, "
"as a percentage of the interface width. Lower values create a larger gap for "
"easier support removal. Height is always 50% of layer height; this controls "
"the width.\n"
"\n"
"The actual width will never go below the extrusion height to prevent "
"extrusion errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"使用半层间隙时底部接触层挤出的宽度，以接触面宽度的百分比表示。值越低，间隙越"
"大，越易于移除支撑。高度始终为层高的 50%；此项控制宽度。\n"
"\n"
"实际宽度永远不会低于挤出高度，以防止挤出错误。\n"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4631
msgid "Enforce support for the first"
msgstr "强制支撑前"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4633
msgid ""
"Generate support material for the specified number of layers counting from "
"bottom, regardless of whether normal support material is enabled or not and "
"regardless of any angle threshold. This is useful for getting more adhesion "
"of objects having a very thin or poor footprint on the build plate."
msgstr ""
"从底部为指定数量的图层生成支撑材料,无论是否启用了普通支撑材料,也无论角度阈值"
"如何。这对于在构建板上具有非常薄或差的封装的物体的粘附性非常有用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4638
msgid "Enforce support for the first n layers"
msgstr "强制支撑前 n 层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4644 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2149
msgid "Support material extruder"
msgstr "支撑材料挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4646
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing support material, raft and skirt (1+, 0 to "
"use the current extruder to minimize tool changes)."
msgstr ""
"打印支撑材料、基座和裙边时使用的挤出机 (1+,0 用于使用当前挤出机以最大限度地减"
"少工具切换)。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4656
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for support "
"material. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage (for "
"example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, "
"depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置支撑材料的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已"
"设置），否则使用喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的"
"百分比”设置，以喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4669
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for support "
"interface layers. If left zero, the Support material extrusion width will be "
"used. If expressed as percentage (for example 90%) it will be computed over "
"nozzle diameter or layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to "
"nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置支撑接触面层的挤出宽度。若保持为零，将使用支撑材料挤出宽"
"度。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以喷嘴直"
"径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4679
msgid "Interface loops"
msgstr "接触面圈数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4681
msgid ""
"Cover the top contact layer of the supports with loops. Disabled by default."
msgstr "用循环盖住支架的顶层接触层。默认情况下禁用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4686 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2151
msgid "Support material interface extruder"
msgstr "支撑材料接触面挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4688
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing support material interface (1+, 0 to use "
"the current extruder to minimize tool changes). This affects raft too."
msgstr ""
"打印支撑材料界面时要使用的挤出机 (1+,0 用于使用当前挤出机以最大限度地减少工具"
"切换)。这也会影响基座。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4695
msgid "Top interface layers"
msgstr "顶层接口层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4697
msgid ""
"Number of solid interface layers between the support structure and the "
"object. These layers distribute the gap specified in 'Top contact Z "
"distance' - more layers allow finer gap control. With fewer layers, the "
"exact gap may not be achievable and will be approximated within safe "
"extrusion limits (25-75% of nozzle diameter per layer)."
msgstr ""
"支撑结构与物体之间的实心接触面层数。这些层分摊“顶部接触 Z 距离”中指定的间隙——"
"层数越多间隙控制越精细。层数较少时，可能无法精确达到所需间隙，将在安全挤出范"
"围内（每层为喷嘴直径的 25-75%）近似实现。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4704 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4723
msgid "0 (none)"
msgstr "0（无）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4705 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4724
msgid "1 (sparse)"
msgstr "1（稀疏）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4706 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4725
msgid "2 (moderate)"
msgstr "2（中等）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4707 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4726
msgid "3 (default)"
msgstr "3（默认）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4708 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4727
msgid "4 (dense)"
msgstr "4（密集）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4713 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1993
msgid "Bottom interface layers"
msgstr "底部界面层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4715
msgid ""
"Number of interface layers to insert between the object(s) and support "
"material. Set to -1 to use the same value as 'Top interface layers'."
msgstr ""
"在物体与支撑材料之间插入的接触面层数。设为 -1 则使用与“顶部接触面层”相同的"
"值。"

#. TRN Print Settings: "Bottom interface layers". Have to be as short as possible
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4722
msgid "Same as top"
msgstr "和上面一样"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4732 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1989
msgid "Closing radius"
msgstr "闭合半径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4734
msgid ""
"For snug supports, the support regions will be merged using morphological "
"closing operation. Gaps smaller than the closing radius will be filled in."
msgstr ""
"对于紧贴支撑，将使用形态闭合操作合并支撑区域。小于闭合半径的间隙将被填充。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4742 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1990
msgid "Minimum support area"
msgstr "最小支撑面积"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4744
msgid ""
"Paint-on support regions smaller than this area will be filtered out. This "
"prevents accidental tiny paint specs from generating support structures.\n"
"\n"
"Reference - circle diameter to area:\n"
"• 0.5mm diameter = 0.2 mm²\n"
"• 1.0mm diameter = 0.79 mm²\n"
"• 1.5mm diameter = 1.77 mm²\n"
"• 2.0mm diameter = 3.14 mm²\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to disable filtering."
msgstr ""
"小于此面积的涂绘支撑区域将被滤除。这可防止意外的微小涂点生成支撑结构。\n"
"\n"
"参考——圆直径对应面积：\n"
"• 直径 0.5mm = 0.2 mm²\n"
"• 直径 1.0mm = 0.79 mm²\n"
"• 直径 1.5mm = 1.77 mm²\n"
"• 直径 2.0mm = 3.14 mm²\n"
"\n"
"设为 0 可禁用滤除。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4758 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1995
msgid "Interface pattern spacing"
msgstr "接触面模式间距"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4760
msgid "Spacing between interface lines. Set zero to get a solid interface."
msgstr "接触面行之间的间距。设置为零以获得实心接触面。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4769
msgid ""
"Speed for printing support material interface layers. If expressed as "
"percentage (for example 50%) it will be calculated over support material "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"打印支撑材料接触面图层的速度。如果以百分比表示（例如 50%）它将在支撑材料速度"
"上计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4778 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1983
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "模式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4780
msgid "Pattern used to generate support material."
msgstr "用于生成支撑材料的模式。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4782
msgid "Rectilinear grid"
msgstr "直线网格"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4787 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1985
msgid "Bridge fill when \"no gap\" selected"
msgstr "选择“无间隙”时使用桥接填充"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4789
msgid ""
"When enabled, bottom surfaces use bridge infill instead of solid infill when "
"support contact distance is set to \"no gap\". Bridge infill uses slower "
"speeds and flow rates optimized for printing over air.\n"
"\n"
"When disabled (default), all bottom surfaces use solid infill when \"no "
"gap\" is selected, since the support provides a stable printing surface.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This applies to all bottom surfaces, not just areas with support "
"underneath."
msgstr ""
"启用后，当支撑接触距离设为“无间隙”时，底面使用桥接填充而非实心填充。桥接填充"
"使用为悬空打印优化的较慢速度和流量。\n"
"\n"
"禁用时（默认），选择“无间隙”时所有底面使用实心填充，因为支撑提供了稳定的打印"
"表面。\n"
"\n"
"注意：这适用于所有底面，而不仅是下方有支撑的区域。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4799 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1994
msgid "Interface pattern"
msgstr "界面模式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4801
msgid ""
"Pattern used to generate support material interface. Default pattern for non-"
"soluble support interface is Rectilinear, while default pattern for soluble "
"support interface is Concentric."
msgstr ""
"用于生成支撑材料界面的图案。非可溶性支架界面的默认模式为直线，而可溶性支架界"
"面的默认模式为同心。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4810 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1987
msgid "Pattern spacing"
msgstr "模式间距"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4812
msgid "Spacing between support material lines."
msgstr "支撑材料线之间的间距。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4821
msgid "Speed for printing support material."
msgstr "打印支撑材料的速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4828 src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoCut.cpp:257
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoEmboss.cpp:2546 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1954
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4831
msgid ""
"Style and shape of the support towers for auto-generated supports. "
"Projecting the supports into a regular grid will create more stable "
"supports, while snug support towers will save material and reduce object "
"scarring. Note: This setting only affects auto-generated supports. Paint-on "
"supports specify their own type (Blocker/Snug/Grid/Organic/Baobab) and will "
"override this setting in painted regions."
msgstr ""
"自动生成支撑的支撑塔样式和形状。将支撑投影到规则网格上会产生更稳定的支撑，而"
"贴合支撑塔则节省材料并减少物体疤痕。注意：此设置仅影响自动生成的支撑。涂绘支"
"撑会指定自己的类型（阻挡/贴合/网格/有机/波巴布），并在绘制区域覆盖此设置。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4836
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:81
msgid "Snug"
msgstr "舒适的"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4836
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:83
msgid "Organic"
msgstr "树状"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4836
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoFdmSupports.cpp:84
msgid "Baobab"
msgstr "波巴布"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4842
msgid "Synchronize with object layers"
msgstr "与对象图层同步"

#. TRN PrintSettings : "Synchronize with object layers"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4845
msgid ""
"Synchronize support layers with the object print layers. This is useful with "
"multi-material printers, where the extruder switch is expensive. This option "
"is only available when top contact Z distance is set to zero."
msgstr ""
"将支撑层与对象打印层同步。这对于多材料打印机很有用，因为挤出机开关很昂贵。仅"
"当顶部接触Z距离设置为零时，此选项才可用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4852 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1955
msgid "Overhang threshold"
msgstr "悬垂阈值"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4854
msgid ""
"Support material will not be generated for overhangs whose slope angle (90° "
"= vertical) is above the given threshold. In other words, this value "
"represent the most horizontal slope (measured from the horizontal plane) "
"that you can print without support material. Set to zero for automatic "
"detection (recommended)."
msgstr ""
"对于斜率（90°= 垂直）高于给定阈值的悬伸，不会生成支撑材料。换句话说，此值表示"
"无需支撑材料即可打印的最水平斜率（从水平平面测量）。设置为零以进行自动检测"
"（建议）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4866
msgid "With sheath around the support"
msgstr "用护套围绕支撑"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4868
msgid ""
"Add a sheath (a single perimeter line) around the base support. This makes "
"the support more reliable, but also more difficult to remove."
msgstr ""
"在基础支架周围添加护套 (一条外围线)。这使得支撑更可靠, 但也更难以移除。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4874 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2022
msgid "Maximum trunk angle"
msgstr "最大树干角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4878
msgid ""
"The maximum angle of the trunks, from vertical, when they have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle to be able to have more reach."
msgstr ""
"树干的最大角度（相对于垂直方向），用于树干需要避开模型时。使用较低的角度，使"
"其更垂直、更稳定。使用较高的角度，可获得更大的延伸范围。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4886 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2023
msgid "Preferred trunk angle"
msgstr "优选的树干角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4890
msgid ""
"The preferred angle of the trunks when they do not have to avoid the model. "
"Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a higher "
"angle for trunks to merge faster."
msgstr ""
"树干的首选角度，当它们不必避开模型时。使用较低的角度，使其更垂直、更稳定。使"
"用较高的角度，可使树干更快地合并。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4898 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2027
msgid "Canopy density"
msgstr "树冠密度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4902
msgid ""
"Density of the lightning fill inside a Baobab support's canopy. The fill "
"carries the support interface across the canopy's mouth. A higher value "
"gives the interface more to land on but uses more material and time."
msgstr ""
"波巴布支撑树冠内闪电填充的密度。填充物将支撑接触面输送到树冠开口处。较高的值"
"为接触面提供更多的落脚区域，但会消耗更多材料和时间。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4910 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2028
msgid "Maximum canopy angle"
msgstr "最大树冠角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4914
msgid ""
"The maximum angle, from vertical, at which a Baobab support's canopy tapers "
"down onto its trunk. A higher angle reaches the trunk sooner and makes a "
"shallower canopy. It is reduced automatically where a layer would grow "
"outward by more than half the support extrusion width, and where a leaning "
"trunk already spends part of that allowance."
msgstr ""
"波巴布支撑树冠向其树干收拢的最大角度（相对于垂直方向）。角度越大，越快到达树"
"干，树冠也越浅。在某一层向外扩展超过支撑挤出宽度一半的位置，以及倾斜的树干已"
"经占用部分该余量的位置，此角度会自动减小。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4924 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2029
msgid "Plant trunks on object"
msgstr "在物体上放置树干"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4928
msgid ""
"Allow trunks to land on stable top surfaces of the object instead of always "
"descending to the build plate. A surface qualifies when it is wide enough "
"for the whole foot and backed by solid material beneath it."
msgstr ""
"允许树干落在物体稳定的顶面上，而不是始终下降到打印床。当某个表面足够宽以容纳"
"整个树干底部，且其下方有实心材料支撑时，该表面才符合条件。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4933 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2024
msgid "Trunk diameter"
msgstr "树干直径"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk diameter"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4936
msgid ""
"The diameter of the thinnest trunks. Thicker trunks are more sturdy. Trunks "
"towards the base will be thicker than this."
msgstr "最细树干的直径。较粗的树干更结实。朝向基部的树干会比这更粗。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4944 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2025
msgid "Trunk diameter angle"
msgstr "树干直径角度"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk diameter angle"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4947
msgid ""
"The angle of the trunks' diameter as they gradually become thicker towards "
"the bottom. An angle of 0 will cause the trunks to have uniform thickness "
"over their length. A bit of an angle can increase stability."
msgstr ""
"树干直径的角度，随着其逐渐向底部变粗。角度为 0 会使树干在其长度上具有均匀的厚"
"度。稍带角度可以增加稳定性。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4956 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2026
msgid "Trunk distance"
msgstr "树干距离"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Baobab supports" > "Trunk distance"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4959
msgid ""
"How much interface area a single trunk gathers: seeds closer than this "
"distance share a trunk, and each canopy reaches this far from its trunk to "
"cover its share of the interface."
msgstr ""
"单根树干能汇集多大的接触面区域：距离小于此值的种子会共用一根树干，每个树冠都"
"会从其树干延伸至该距离，以覆盖其应负责的那部分接触面。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4967 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2007
msgid "Maximum branch angle"
msgstr "最大分支角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4971
msgid ""
"The maximum angle of the branches, when the branches have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle to be able to have more reach."
msgstr ""
"树枝的最大角度，当树枝要避开模型的时候。使用较低的角度，使它们更垂直，更稳"
"定。使用较高的角度，能够有更多的触角。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4980 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2008
msgid "Preferred branch angle"
msgstr "优选的分支角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4984
msgid ""
"The preferred angle of the branches, when they do not have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle for branches to merge faster."
msgstr ""
"枝条的首选角度，当它们不必避开模型时。使用较低的角度，使它们更垂直，更稳定。"
"使用较高的角度，使树枝更快地合并起来。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4993 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2013
msgid "Tip diameter"
msgstr "尖端直径"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Tip diameter"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4996
msgid "Branch tip diameter for organic supports."
msgstr "树状支撑物的枝梢直径。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5004 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2009
msgid "Branch diameter"
msgstr "分支直径"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch diameter"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5007
msgid ""
"The diameter of the thinnest branches of organic support. Thicker branches "
"are more sturdy. Branches towards the base will be thicker than this."
msgstr "树状支撑的最细枝条的直径。较粗的枝条更结实。朝向基部的枝条会比这更粗。"

#. TRN PrintSettings: #lmFIXME
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5017 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2010
msgid "Branch diameter angle"
msgstr "分支直径角度"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch diameter angle"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5020
msgid ""
"The angle of the branches' diameter as they gradually become thicker towards "
"the bottom. An angle of 0 will cause the branches to have uniform thickness "
"over their length. A bit of an angle can increase stability of the organic "
"support."
msgstr ""
"枝条直径的角度，因为它们逐渐向底部变粗。角度为0会使树枝在其长度上具有均匀的厚"
"度。有点角度可以增加有机支架的稳定性。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5030 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2012
msgid "Branch diameter with double walls"
msgstr "带有双壁的分支直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5034
msgid ""
"Branches with area larger than the area of a circle of this diameter will be "
"printed with double walls for stability. Set this value to zero for no "
"double walls."
msgstr ""
"面积大于此直径的圆面积的枝条将被打印成双壁以保持稳定。将此值设为零表示没有双"
"壁。"

#. TRN PrintSettings: #lmFIXME
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5047 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2014
msgid "Branch distance"
msgstr "分支距离"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch distance"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5050
msgid ""
"How far apart the branches need to be when they touch the model. Making this "
"distance small will cause the tree support to touch the model at more "
"points, causing better overhang but making support harder to remove."
msgstr ""
"当树枝接触到模型时，需要间隔多远。把这个距离变小会使树木的支撑物在更多的地方"
"接触到模型，造成更好的悬空，但使支撑物更难移除。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5057 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2015
msgid "Branch density"
msgstr "分支密度"

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch density"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5060
msgid ""
"Adjusts the density of the support structure used to generate the tips of "
"the branches. A higher value results in better overhangs but the supports "
"are harder to remove, thus it is recommended to enable top support "
"interfaces instead of a high branch density value if dense interfaces are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"调整用于生成枝梢的支撑结构的密度。较高的值会产生更好的悬垂，但支撑物更难移"
"除，因此，如果需要密集的界面，建议启用顶部支撑界面，而不是高枝条密度值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5072
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature for layers after the first one. Set this to zero to keep "
"the first layer nozzle temperature for the entire print."
msgstr "首层之后各层的喷嘴温度。设为零可在整个打印过程中保持首层喷嘴温度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5075
msgid "Nozzle temperature"
msgstr "喷嘴温度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5085
msgid "Thick bridges"
msgstr "厚桥"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5087
msgid ""
"Deprecated: This setting is disabled in preFlight. Thick bridges interfere "
"with support interface gap calculations."
msgstr ""
"已弃用：此设置在 preFlight 中已禁用。厚桥接会干扰支撑接触面间隙的计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5093
msgid "Detect thin walls"
msgstr "检测薄壁"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5095
msgid ""
"Detect single-width walls (parts where two extrusions don't fit and we need "
"to collapse them into a single trace)."
msgstr ""
"检测单宽度壁（无法容纳两个挤出线的零件，我们需要将它们折叠成单个轨迹）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5103
msgid ""
"This custom code is inserted before every toolchange. Placeholder variables "
"for all preFlight settings as well as {toolchange_z}, {previous_extruder} "
"and {next_extruder} can be used. When a tool-changing command which changes "
"to the correct extruder is included (such as T{next_extruder}), preFlight "
"will emit no other such command. It is therefore possible to script custom "
"behaviour both before and after the toolchange."
msgstr ""
"此自定义代码在每次工具更改之前插入。可以使用所有 preFlight 设置的占位符变量以"
"及 {toolchange_z}、{previous_extruder} 和 {next_extruder}。当包含更改为正确挤"
"出机的换刀命令时（如 T{next_extruder}），preFlight 不会发出其他此类命令。因"
"此，可以在工具更改前后编写自定义行为脚本。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5117
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for infill for "
"top surfaces. You may want to use thinner extrudates to fill all narrow "
"regions and get a smoother finish. If left zero, default extrusion width "
"will be used if set, otherwise nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as "
"percentage (for example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or "
"layer height, depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"设为非零值可手动设置顶面填充的挤出宽度。你可能希望使用更细的挤出以填满所有窄"
"区域并获得更平滑的表面。若保持为零，将使用默认挤出宽度（若已设置），否则使用"
"喷嘴直径。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），将根据“相对于喷嘴尺寸的百分比”设置，以"
"喷嘴直径或层高为基准计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5130
msgid ""
"Speed for printing top solid layers (it only applies to the uppermost "
"external layers and not to their internal solid layers). You may want to "
"slow down this to get a nicer surface finish. This can be expressed as a "
"percentage (for example: 80%) over the solid infill speed above. Set to zero "
"for auto."
msgstr ""
"打印顶部实体图层的速度（它仅适用于最上面的外部图层，不适用于其内部实心图"
"层）。您可能需要减慢速度，以获得更好的表面光洁度。这可以表示为百分比（例如："
"80%）超过上面的固体填充速度。为自动设置为零。"

#. TRN Print Settings: "Top solid layers"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5143 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5151
msgctxt "Layers"
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5145
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on top surfaces."
msgstr "要在顶部曲面上生成的实心图层数。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5146 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1727
msgid "Top solid layers"
msgstr "顶部实心层"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5153
msgid ""
"The number of top solid layers is increased above top_solid_layers if "
"necessary to satisfy minimum thickness of top shell. This is useful to "
"prevent pillowing effect when printing with variable layer height."
msgstr ""
"如果需要满足顶部外壳的最小厚度，顶部实体层的数量将增加到顶部实体层之上。这有"
"助于防止在使用可变层高打印时出现起球效应。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5156
msgid "Minimum top shell thickness"
msgstr "最小顶壳厚度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5162 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1804
msgid "Top surface flow reduction"
msgstr "顶面流量降低"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5164
msgid ""
"Reduces extrusion flow for visible top surfaces (perimeters and solid "
"infill). This helps prevent overextrusion artifacts on visible surfaces. The "
"percentage is subtracted from 100% (e.g., 3% means 97% flow). Set to 0% to "
"disable. Top solid infill always uses reduced flow when enabled; perimeters "
"use visibility detection to only reduce flow on truly visible segments."
msgstr ""
"降低可见顶面（轮廓和实心填充）的挤出流量。这有助于防止可见表面上的过挤出瑕"
"疵。该百分比从 100% 中减去（例如 3% 表示 97% 流量）。设为 0% 可禁用。启用时顶"
"部实心填充始终使用降低的流量；轮廓使用可见性检测，仅在真正可见的段上降低流"
"量。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5178
msgid ""
"Controls how precisely the boundary between visible and hidden perimeter "
"segments is detected. Higher precision means more accurate boundaries but "
"slower slicing.\n"
"\n"
"• Precise (1mm): Highest accuracy, samples every 1mm along perimeters\n"
"• Standard (2mm): Good balance of accuracy and speed (recommended)\n"
"• Relaxed (4mm): Faster slicing with slightly less precise boundaries\n"
"• Minimal (8mm): Fastest, may miss some visibility transitions"
msgstr ""
"控制可见与隐藏轮廓段之间边界的检测精度。精度越高，边界越准确，但切片越慢。\n"
"\n"
"• 精确（1mm）：精度最高，沿轮廓每 1mm 采样一次\n"
"• 标准（2mm）：精度与速度的良好平衡（推荐）\n"
"• 宽松（4mm）：切片更快，边界略不精确\n"
"• 最低（8mm）：最快，可能漏掉一些可见性转变"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5185
msgid "Precise (1mm)"
msgstr "精确（1mm）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5186
msgid "Standard (2mm)"
msgstr "标准（2mm）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5187
msgid "Relaxed (4mm)"
msgstr "宽松（4mm）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5188
msgid "Minimal (8mm)"
msgstr "最低（8mm）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5194 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1894
msgid "Merge top solid infills"
msgstr "合并顶部实心填充"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5196
msgid ""
"When enabled, top solid infills will be merged with adjacent internal solid "
"infills to improve print efficiency. WARNING: On certain objects, this "
"feature may incorrectly convert solid infill into top solid infill, or cause "
"slight misalignment of top surface patterns. Disable if precise top surface "
"alignment is critical."
msgstr ""
"启用后，顶部实心填充将与相邻的内部实心填充合并以提高打印效率。警告：在某些物"
"体上，此功能可能错误地将实心填充转换为顶部实心填充，或导致顶面图案轻微错位。"
"如果精确的顶面对齐至关重要，请禁用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5204 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1881
msgid "Narrow to Athena"
msgstr "窄区转 Athena"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5206
msgid ""
"Replace zigzag patterns in narrow solid infill areas with Athena variable-"
"width fill. Athena generates clean adaptive-width paths that follow the "
"contour of narrow regions without zigzags or tight loop artifacts. Areas "
"narrower than the Narrow threshold will be converted. Applies to internal "
"solid, top solid, and bottom solid infill. Does not affect bridge infill."
msgstr ""
"用 Athena 可变宽度填充替换窄实心填充区域中的锯齿图案。Athena 生成沿窄区域轮廓"
"的干净自适应宽度路径，没有锯齿或紧密环路瑕疵。窄于“窄区阈值”的区域将被转换。"
"适用于内部实心、顶部实心和底部实心填充。不影响桥接填充。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5215
msgid "Narrow threshold"
msgstr "窄区阈值"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5217
msgid ""
"Solid infill areas (internal, top, and bottom) narrower than this many "
"extrusion widths will use Athena variable-width fill instead of the "
"configured fill pattern. Only applies when 'Narrow to Athena' is enabled."
msgstr ""
"窄于此挤出宽度倍数的实心填充区域（内部、顶部和底部）将使用 Athena 可变宽度填"
"充，而非配置的填充图案。仅在启用“窄区转 Athena”时适用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5220
msgid "x extrusion width"
msgstr "x 挤出宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5227 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1882
msgid "Narrow to Athena on top/bottom"
msgstr "顶面/底面窄区转 Athena"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5229
msgid ""
"Also apply Narrow to Athena to top and bottom solid surfaces, not only "
"internal solid. Thin areas of these visible surfaces convert to a smooth "
"Athena bead instead of the configured pattern, while wider areas keep it. "
"Only applies when 'Narrow to Athena' is enabled."
msgstr ""
"将\"窄区转 Athena\"也应用于顶面和底面实心区域，而不仅限于内部实心。这些可见面"
"的细窄区域将转换为平滑的 Athena 挤出线，而非配置的图案；较宽区域保持不变。仅"
"在启用\"窄区转 Athena\"时生效。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5237
msgid "Speed for travel moves (jumps between distant extrusion points)."
msgstr "打印移动的速度（在远处挤出点之间跳跃）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5245 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2087
msgid "Z travel"
msgstr "行程"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5246
msgid ""
"Speed for movements along the Z axis.\n"
"When set to zero, the value is ignored and regular travel speed is used "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"沿 Z 轴移动的速度。\n"
"当设置为零时，该值将被忽略，而使用常规行驶速度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5254 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3816
msgid "Use firmware retraction"
msgstr "使用固件回抽"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5255
msgid ""
"This setting uses G10 and G11 commands to have the firmware handle the "
"retraction. Note that this has to be supported by firmware."
msgstr "此设置使用 G10 和 G11 指令让固件处理回抽。请注意，这需要固件支持。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5261 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3815
msgid "Use relative E distances"
msgstr "使用相对 E 距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5262
msgid ""
"If your firmware requires relative E values, check this, otherwise leave it "
"unchecked. Most firmwares use absolute values."
msgstr ""
"如果您的固件需要相对的 E 值，请检查这一点，否则不要选中它。大多数固件使用绝对"
"值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5268 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3817
msgid "Use volumetric E"
msgstr "使用体积 E"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5269
msgid ""
"This experimental setting uses outputs the E values in cubic millimeters "
"instead of linear millimeters. If your firmware doesn't already know "
"filament diameter(s), you can put commands like 'M200 D[filament_diameter_0] "
"T0' in your start G-code in order to turn volumetric mode on and use the "
"filament diameter associated to the filament selected in Slic3r. This is "
"only supported in recent Marlin."
msgstr ""
"此实验设置使用以立方 mm 为单位的 E 值而不是线性 mm。如果您的固件不知道耗材直"
"径，您可以将诸如 \"M200D[filament_diameter_0]T0\" 这样的命令放入起始 G-Code "
"中，以便打开体积模式并使用与 Slic3r 中选择的耗材相关的耗材直径。这在最近 "
"Marlin 中才得到支持。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5279 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3821
msgid "Machine hourly rate"
msgstr "机器小时费率"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5280
msgid ""
"Hourly operating cost of this printer. Combined with filament cost to "
"calculate total job cost."
msgstr "此打印机的每小时运行成本。与耗材成本结合以计算作业总成本。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5281
msgid "/h"
msgstr "/小时"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5287 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3820
msgid "Currency symbol"
msgstr "货币符号"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5288
msgid "Currency symbol displayed with cost estimates (e.g. $, EUR, GBP)."
msgstr "与成本估算一同显示的货币符号（例如 $、EUR、GBP）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5293
msgid "Enable variable layer height feature"
msgstr "启用可变图层高度特征"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5294
msgid ""
"Some printers or printer setups may have difficulties printing with a "
"variable layer height. Enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"某些打印机或打印机设置在打印图层高度可变时可能遇到问题。默认情况下启用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5300 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3819
msgid "Prefer clockwise movements"
msgstr "优先顺时针移动"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5301
msgid ""
"This setting makes the printer print loops clockwise instead of "
"counterclockwise."
msgstr "此设置使打印机以顺时针而非逆时针打印环路。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5306 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:5592
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:7093
msgid "Wipe while retracting"
msgstr "回抽时擦拭"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5307
msgid ""
"This flag will move the nozzle while retracting to minimize the possible "
"blob on leaky extruders."
msgstr "此标志将在回抽时移动喷嘴，以尽量减少泄漏挤出器上可能出现的斑点。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5314
msgid ""
"Multi material printers may need to prime or purge extruders on tool "
"changes. Extrude the excess material into the wipe tower."
msgstr ""
"多材料打印机可能需要对工具更换进行填充清洗或清除挤出机。将多余的材料挤出到擦"
"料塔中。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5320
msgid "Purging volumes - matrix"
msgstr "清除量-矩阵"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5321
msgid ""
"This matrix describes volumes (in cubic milimetres) required to purge the "
"new filament on the wipe tower for any given pair of tools."
msgstr ""
"此矩阵描述清除擦料塔上任何给定工具对的新耗材所需的体积（以立方米为单位）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5333 src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoCut.cpp:263
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2169 src/slic3r/GUI/ThumbnailsDialog.cpp:142
msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5334
msgid "Width of a wipe tower"
msgstr "擦料塔的宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5340 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5341
msgid "Wipe tower brim width"
msgstr "擦拭塔裙边宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5348
msgid "Stabilization cone apex angle"
msgstr "稳定锥顶角"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5349
msgid ""
"Angle at the apex of the cone that is used to stabilize the wipe tower. "
"Larger angle means wider base."
msgstr "锥体顶端的角度，用于稳定擦拭塔。角度越大意味着底座越宽。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5358
msgid "Wipe tower purge lines spacing"
msgstr "擦拭塔清洗线的间距"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5359
msgid "Spacing of purge lines on the wipe tower."
msgstr "擦拭塔上的清洗线的间距。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5367
msgid "Extra flow for purging"
msgstr "清料额外流量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5369
msgid ""
"Extra flow used for the purging lines on the wipe tower. This makes the "
"purging lines thicker or narrower than they normally would be. The spacing "
"is adjusted automatically."
msgstr ""
"擦拭塔上清料线所用的额外流量。这会使清料线比通常更粗或更细。间距会自动调整。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5378 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5386
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:98 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:188
msgid "Wipe options"
msgstr "擦除选项"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5379
msgid "Wipe into this object's infill"
msgstr "擦入此物体的填充"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5380
msgid ""
"Purging after toolchange will be done inside this object's infills. This "
"lowers the amount of waste but may result in longer print time  due to "
"additional travel moves."
msgstr ""
"工具更改后的清除将在该对象的填充内完成。这降低了浪费量，但由于额外的行程移"
"动，可能会导致更长的打印时间。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5387
msgid "Wipe into this object"
msgstr "擦除到此对象"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5388
msgid ""
"Object will be used to purge the nozzle after a toolchange to save material "
"that would otherwise end up in the wipe tower and decrease print time. "
"Colours of the objects will be mixed as a result."
msgstr ""
"对象将用于在工具更改后清除喷嘴, 以节省在擦料塔中浪费的材料并减少打印时间。因"
"此, 对象的颜色将混合在一起。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5394
msgid "Maximal bridging distance"
msgstr "最大桥接距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5395
msgid "Maximal distance between supports on sparse infill sections."
msgstr "稀疏填充部分上支撑之间的最大距离。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5401 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:2152
msgid "Wipe tower extruder"
msgstr "擦拭塔挤出机"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5403
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing perimeter of the wipe tower. Set to 0 to "
"use the one that is available (non-soluble would be preferred)."
msgstr ""
"打印擦拭塔轮廓时使用的挤出机。设为 0 则使用可用的挤出机（优先非可溶性）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5422
msgid "XY Size Compensation"
msgstr "XY 尺寸补偿"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5424
msgid ""
"The object will be grown/shrunk in the XY plane by the configured value "
"(negative = inwards, positive = outwards). This might be useful for fine-"
"tuning hole sizes."
msgstr ""
"对象将在 XY 平面中按配置的值（负 = 向内、正 = 向外）进行增长/收缩。这对于微调"
"孔大小可能很有用。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5432 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:3588
msgid "Z offset"
msgstr "Z 偏移"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5433
msgid ""
"This value will be added (or subtracted) from all the Z coordinates in the "
"output G-code. It is used to compensate for bad Z endstop position: for "
"example, if your endstop zero actually leaves the nozzle 0.3mm far from the "
"print bed, set this to -0.3 (or fix your endstop)."
msgstr ""
"此值将从输出 G-Code 中的所有 Z 坐标中添加(或减去)。它用于补偿损坏的 Z 端限位"
"器置：例如，如果限位器零实际离开喷嘴 0.3mm 远离构建板(打印床)，将其设置为 "
"-0.3（或调整限位器）。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5442 src/slic3r/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1783
msgid "Perimeter generator"
msgstr "轮廓生成器"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5445
msgid ""
"Athena (Precise) produces precise perimeters with exact user-specified "
"widths for maximum dimensional accuracy. Arachne (Variable) produces "
"perimeters with variable extrusion width for better handling of thin walls "
"and complex details. This setting also affects the Concentric infill."
msgstr ""
"Athena（精确）生成精确的轮廓，宽度严格按用户指定，以获得最大尺寸精度。Arachne"
"（可变）生成挤出宽度可变的轮廓，更好地处理薄壁和复杂细节。此设置也影响同心填"
"充。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5449
msgid "Athena (Precise)"
msgstr "Athena（精确）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5450
msgid "Arachne (Variable)"
msgstr "Arachne（可变）"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5455
msgid "Perimeter transition length"
msgstr "轮廓过渡长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5458
msgid ""
"When transitioning between different numbers of perimeters as the part "
"becomes thinner, a certain amount of space is allotted to split or join the "
"perimeter segments. If expressed as a percentage (for example 100%), it will "
"be computed based on the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"当随着零件变薄而在不同数量的轮廓之间过渡时，会分配出一定的空间来分割或连接轮"
"廓段。如果用百分比表示（例如 100%），它将根据喷嘴直径计算出来。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5467
msgid "Perimeter transition filter margin"
msgstr "轮廓过渡过滤裕量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5470
msgid ""
"Prevent transitioning back and forth between one extra perimeter and one "
"less. This margin extends the range of extrusion widths which follow to "
"[Minimum perimeter width - margin, 2 * Minimum perimeter width + margin]. "
"Increasing this margin reduces the number of transitions, which reduces the "
"number of extrusion starts/stops and travel time. However, large extrusion "
"width variation can lead to under- or overextrusion problems. If expressed "
"as a percentage (for example 25%), it will be computed based on the nozzle "
"diameter."
msgstr ""
"防止在多一个轮廓和少一个轮廓之间来回过渡。这个余量将挤压宽度的范围扩大到 [最"
"小轮廓宽度-余量, 2*最小轮廓宽度+余量]。增加这个余量可以减少转换的次数，从而减"
"少挤压开始/停止的次数和移动时间。然而，大的挤出宽度变化会导致挤出不足或过度挤"
"出的问题。如果用百分比表示（例如25%），将根据喷嘴直径计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5483
msgid "Perimeter transition angle"
msgstr "轮廓过渡角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5485
msgid ""
"When to create transitions between even and odd numbers of perimeters. A "
"wedge shape with an angle greater than this setting will not have "
"transitions and no perimeters will be printed in the center to fill the "
"remaining space. Reducing this setting reduces the number and length of "
"these center perimeters, but may leave gaps or overextrude."
msgstr ""
"何时在偶数和奇数轮廓之间创建过渡。 角度大于此设置的楔形将没有过渡，并且不会在"
"中心打印轮廓以填充剩余空间。 减少此设置会减少这些中心轮廓的数量和长度，但可能"
"会留下间隙或过度拉伸。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5496
msgid "Perimeter distribution count"
msgstr "轮廓分布计数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5498
msgid ""
"The number of perimeters, counted from the center, over which the variation "
"needs to be spread. Lower values mean that the outer perimeters don't change "
"in width."
msgstr ""
"从中心开始计算的轮廓数量，变化需要在这些轮廓上展开。较低的值意味着外部轮廓的"
"宽度不发生变化。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5505
msgid "Minimum feature size"
msgstr "最小特征尺寸"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5508
msgid ""
"Minimum thickness of thin features. Model features thinner than this value "
"are not generated. If expressed as a percentage (for example 25%), it will "
"be computed based on the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"薄特征的最小厚度。比此值更薄的模型特征不会生成。若以百分比表示（例如 25%），"
"将根据喷嘴直径计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5516
msgid "Minimum perimeter width"
msgstr "最小轮廓宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5519
msgid ""
"Width of the perimeter that will replace thin features (according to the "
"Minimum feature size) of the model. If the Minimum perimeter width is "
"thinner than the thickness of the feature, the perimeter will become as "
"thick as the feature itself. If expressed as a percentage (for example 85%), "
"it will be computed based on the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"将替换模型的细特征（根据最小特征尺寸）的轮廓宽度。 如果最小轮廓宽度小于特征的"
"厚度，则轮廓将变得与特征本身一样厚。 如果以百分比表示（例如 85%），它将根据喷"
"嘴直径计算。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5674
msgid "Pinhead front diameter"
msgstr "针头前端直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5675 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5684
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5693 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5703
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5713 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5733
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5755 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5762
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5776 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5786
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5795 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5807
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5817 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5831
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5841 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6196
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6217 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6224
#: src/slic3r/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:128
#: src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_Factories.cpp:193
msgid "Supports"
msgstr "支持"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5676
msgid "Diameter of the pointing side of the head"
msgstr "头部指向侧的直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5683
msgid "Head penetration"
msgstr "头部穿透"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5685
msgid "How much the pinhead has to penetrate the model surface"
msgstr "针头穿透模型表面的程度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5692
msgid "Pinhead width"
msgstr "针头宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5694
msgid "Width from the back sphere center to the front sphere center"
msgstr "从后球体中心到前球体中心的宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5702
msgid "Pillar diameter"
msgstr "立柱直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5704
msgid "Diameter in mm of the support pillars"
msgstr "支撑柱的直径以 mm 为单位"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5712
msgid "Small pillar diameter percent"
msgstr "小矿柱直径百分比"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5714
msgid ""
"The percentage of smaller pillars compared to the normal pillar diameter "
"which are used in problematic areas where a normal pilla cannot fit."
msgstr "与正常支柱直径相比，较小支柱的百分比，用于正常支柱无法安装的问题区域。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5723
msgid "Max bridges on a pillar"
msgstr "支柱上的最大桥接数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5724
msgid ""
"Maximum number of bridges that can be placed on a pillar. Bridges hold "
"support point pinheads and connect to pillars as small branches."
msgstr ""
"可放置在支柱上的桥梁的最大数量。桥上有支撑点针头，并以小树枝的形式连接到柱子"
"上。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5732
msgid "Max weight on model"
msgstr "模型上的最大重量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5735
msgid ""
"Maximum weight of sub-trees that terminate on the model instead of the print "
"bed. The weight is the sum of the lenghts of all branches emanating from the "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""
"终止于模型而不是打印床的子树的最大重量。该重量是所有从端点发出的分支的长度之"
"和。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5743
msgid "Pillar connection mode"
msgstr "立柱连接方式"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5744
msgid ""
"Controls the bridge type between two neighboring pillars. Can be zig-zag, "
"cross (double zig-zag) or dynamic which will automatically switch between "
"the first two depending on the distance of the two pillars."
msgstr ""
"控制两个相邻支柱之间的桥接类型。可以是锯齿形、交叉（双锯齿形）或动态，根据两"
"个支柱的距离，在前两个柱之间自动切换。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5749
msgid "Zig-Zag"
msgstr "锯齿形"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5749
msgid "Cross"
msgstr "交叉"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5749
msgid "Dynamic"
msgstr "动态"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5756
msgid ""
"Only create support if it lies on a build plate. Don't create support on a "
"print."
msgstr "仅当支撑位于构建板上时，才能创建支撑。不要在打印上创建支撑。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5761
msgid "Pillar widening factor"
msgstr "支柱加宽系数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5764
msgid ""
"Merging bridges or pillars into another pillars can increase the radius. "
"Zero means no increase, one means full increase. The exact amount of "
"increase is unspecified and can change in the future."
msgstr ""
"将桥或柱子并入另一个柱子可以增加半径。零意味着不增加，一意味着完全增加。具体"
"的增加量没有规定，将来可能会改变。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5775
msgid "Support base diameter"
msgstr "支撑基直径"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5777
msgid "Diameter in mm of the pillar base"
msgstr "柱底直径以 mm 为单位"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5785
msgid "Support base height"
msgstr "支撑基座高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5787
msgid "The height of the pillar base cone"
msgstr "柱底锥的高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5794
msgid "Support base safety distance"
msgstr "支撑基部安全距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5796
msgid ""
"The minimum distance of the pillar base from the model in mm. Makes sense in "
"zero elevation mode where a gap according to this parameter is inserted "
"between the model and the pad."
msgstr ""
"柱基与模型的最小距离 (以 mm 为单位) 在零高程模式下有意义,在模型和焊盘之间插入"
"根据此参数的间隙。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5806
msgid "Critical angle"
msgstr "临界角度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5808
msgid "The default angle for connecting support sticks and junctions."
msgstr "用于连接支撑杆和结的默认角度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5816
msgid "Max bridge length"
msgstr "最大桥长"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5818
msgid "The max length of a bridge"
msgstr "搭桥的最大长度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5830
msgid "Max pillar linking distance"
msgstr "最大柱线链接距离"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5832
msgid ""
"The max distance of two pillars to get linked with each other. A zero value "
"will prohibit pillar cascading."
msgstr "两根柱子相互连接的最大距离。零值将禁止柱级联。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5840
msgid "Object elevation"
msgstr "对象高程"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5842
msgid ""
"How much the supports should lift up the supported object. If \"Pad around "
"object\" is enabled, this value is ignored."
msgstr "支撑应提升受支撑的对象。如果启用了\"对象周围的键盘\"，则忽略此值。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5858
msgid "Display width"
msgstr "显示宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5859
msgid "Width of the display"
msgstr "显示宽度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5864
msgid "Display height"
msgstr "显示高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5865
msgid "Height of the display"
msgstr "显示高度"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5870
msgid "Number of pixels in"
msgstr "像素点的数量"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5872
msgid "Number of pixels in X"
msgstr "X 中的像素数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5878
msgid "Number of pixels in Y"
msgstr "Y 中的像素数"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5883
msgid "Display horizontal mirroring"
msgstr "显示水平镜像"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5884 src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoSVG.cpp:2285
msgid "Mirror horizontally"
msgstr "水平镜像"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5885
msgid "Enable horizontal mirroring of output images"
msgstr "启用输出图像的水平镜像"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5890
msgid "Display vertical mirroring"
msgstr "显示垂直镜像"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5891 src/slic3r/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoSVG.cpp:2275
msgid "Mirror vertically"
msgstr "垂直镜像"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5892
msgid "Enable vertical mirroring of output images"
msgstr "启用输出图像的垂直镜像"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5897
msgid "Display orientation"
msgstr "显示方向"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5898
msgid ""
"Set the actual LCD display orientation inside the SLA printer. Portrait mode "
"will flip the meaning of display width and height parameters and the output "
"images will be rotated by 90 degrees."
msgstr ""
"在 SLA 打印机内设置实际的 LCD 显示方向。人像模式将翻转显示宽度和高度参数的含"
"义, 输出图像将旋转 90 度。"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5902
msgid "Landscape"
msgstr "景观"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5903
msgid "Portrait"
msgstr "肖像"

#. TRN ArrangeDialog: Type of "Geometry handling"
#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5908 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6402
#: src/slic3r/GUI/ArrangeSettingsDialogImgui.cpp:113
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:8008
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5909
msgid "Fast tilt"
msgstr "快速倾斜"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5910
msgid "Time of the fast tilt"
msgstr "快速倾斜的时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5917 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6402
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:8009
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "慢"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5918
msgid "Slow tilt"
msgstr "缓慢倾斜"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5919
msgid "Time of the slow tilt"
msgstr "缓慢倾斜的时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5926 src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:6402
#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:8010
msgid "High viscosity"
msgstr "高粘性"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5927
msgid "Tilt for high viscosity resin"
msgstr "高粘性树脂倾斜"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5928
msgid "Time of the super slow tilt"
msgstr "超慢倾斜的时间"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5935
msgid "Area fill threshold"
msgstr "区域填充阈值"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5937
msgid ""
"The value is expressed as a percentage of the bed area. If the area of a "
"particular layer is smaller than 'area_fill', then 'Below area fill "
"threshold' parameters are used to determine the layer separation (tearing) "
"procedure. Otherwise 'Above area fill threshold' parameters are used."
msgstr ""
"该值以热床面积的百分比表示。如果某一层的面积小于“area_fill”，则使用“低于区域"
"填充阈值”参数来确定层分离（撕离）过程。否则使用“高于区域填充阈值”参数。"

