#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1924
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers to generate on top and bottom surfaces. These layers "
"provide a finished appearance and structural support for the printed object."
msgstr "在顶面和底面生成的实心层数。这些层为打印物体提供精致的外观和结构支撑。"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1930
msgid "Minimum shell thickness"
msgstr "最小壳体厚度"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1931
msgid ""
"Minimum thickness (in mm) of top and bottom shells. The layer count will be "
"automatically increased if needed to meet this thickness, which helps "
"prevent pillowing on top surfaces when using variable layer heights."
msgstr ""
"顶壳和底壳的最小厚度（mm）。如有需要，层数将自动增加以达到此厚度，这有助于在"
"使用可变层高时防止顶面凹陷。"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1964
msgid ""
"Serpentine prints each region as one continuous line that replaces "
"perimeters and infill. While enabled, perimeter counts, fill density, fill "
"pattern and most related settings are ignored for the region.\n"
"Serpentine is not suitable for all geometry and may produce poor results on "
"complex shapes. It works best on simple, symmetric parts such as nuts, "
"bolts, and knurled knobs."
msgstr ""
"蛇形将每个区域打印为一条连续线，取代轮廓和填充。启用期间，该区域的轮廓数量、"
"填充密度、填充图案及大多数相关设置都会被忽略。\n"
"蛇形并非适用于所有几何形状，在复杂形状上可能产生较差的效果。它在螺母、螺栓、"
"滚花旋钮等简单对称的零件上效果最佳。"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1978
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and visible surfaces. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互锁轮廓与可见表面之间的实心层数。确保互锁图案完全隐藏在物体内部。"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:1994
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT! The default Interlocking overlap of 10.73% is a safe starting "
"point that works across a wide range of print settings.\n"
"Interlocking can tolerate higher overlap values which compresses more "
"material into the interlocking pattern, resulting in a stronger bond.\n"
"Start with a test print at 10.73% and increase gradually until over-"
"extrusion is reached, then dial it back to the last safe value."
msgstr ""
"重要！默认的 10.73% 互锁重叠是一个安全起点，适用于多种打印设置。\n"
"互锁可以容忍更高的重叠值，将更多材料压入互锁图案，从而获得更强的粘合。\n"
"先以 10.73% 进行测试打印，逐步增加直到出现过挤出，然后回调到最后一个安全值。"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2004
msgid "Quality (slower slicing)"
msgstr "质量（较慢的切片）"

#: src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp:2067
